<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Macedonian Arli Romani</book>
  <para style="h">Matej</para>
  <para style="toc1">O evangelije e Matejeskoro</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matej</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mt</para>
  <para style="mt1">O Evangelije e Matejeskoro</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">E Hristoskere predcija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Akavaj o spisako taro parapapija e Isuse Hristoskere, o Čhavo e Davideskoro, o Čhavo e Avraameskoro:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />e Avraameske bijandilo o Isak,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">e Isakoske bijandilo o Jakov,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">e Jakoveske bijandilo o Juda hem o phrajla leskere,<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />e Judaske e Tamaraja bijandile o Fares hem o Zara.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">E Fareseske bijandilo o Esrom,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">e Esromeske bijandilo o Aram,<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />e Arameske bijandilo o Aminadav,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">e Aminadaveske bijandilo o Naason,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">e Naasoneske bijandilo o Salmon.<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />E Salmonske e Raavaja bijandilo o Vooz,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">e Voozeske e Rutaja bijandilo o Ovid,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">e Ovideske bijandilo o Jesej,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />e Jesejeske bijandilo o car David.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:6">A e Davideske bijandilo o Solomon, a i daj leskiri sine i purani romni e Urijaskiri.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />E Solomoneske bijandilo o Rovoam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">e Rovoameske bijandilo o Avija,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">e Avijeske bijandilo o Asa,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />e Asaveske bijandilo o Josafat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">e Josafateske bijandilo o Joram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">e Jorameske bijandilo o Ozija,<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />e Ozijaske bijandilo o Joatam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">e Joatameske bijandilo o Ahaz,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">e Ahazeske bijandilo o Ezekija,<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />e Ezekijaske bijandilo o Manasija,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">e Manasijaske bijandilo o Amon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">e Amoneske bijandilo o Josija,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />e Josijaske bijandilo o Jehonija hem o phrajla leskere ko vreme koga o narodo tari Judeja preselisalilo ko Vavilon.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />A palo Vavilonsko preselibe e Jehonijaske bijandilo o Salatiil,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">e Salatiileske bijandilo o Zorovavel,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />e Zorovaveleske bijandilo o Aviud,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">e Aviudeske bijandilo o Elijakim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">e Elijakimeske bijandilo o Azor,<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />e Azoreske bijandilo o Sadok,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">e Sadokeske bijandilo o Ahim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">e Ahimeske bijandilo o Eliud,<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />e Eliudeske bijandilo o Eleazar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">e Eleazareske bijandilo o Matan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">e Mataneske bijandilo o Jakov.<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />E Jakoveske bijandilo o Josif, o rom e Marijakoro, so bijangja e Isuse, soj tano o Hristos.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Agjar sine dešuštar generacije taro Avraam dži ko David, dešuštar taro David dži ko preselibe ko Vavilon, hem dešuštar taro Vavilonsko preselibe dži ko Hristos.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O bijanibe e Isuseskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />A o bijanibe e Isuse Hristoskoro sine agjar: Leskiri daj i Marija sine manglardi e Josifeske, ama pred te len pe, oj ačhili khamni taro Sveti Duh. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Lakoro rom, o Josif sine pravedno manuš, i adaleske so na mangla te ladžakerel la javno anglo sarine, mangla te mukhel la tajno.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ama koga razmislingja te kerel adava, o angjeli e Gospodareskoro alo leske ko suno hem phengja leske: “Josif, čhavo e Davideskoro, ma dara te le e Marija romnake, soske o čhavo soj ki late tano taro Sveti Duh. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Oj ka bijanel čhavo, hem ka de le o anav Isus, soske ov ka spasinel pe narodo taro lengere grevija.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Sa adava ulo te phergjol adava so o Gospodari phengja preku o proroko:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Akje čhaj ka ačhol khamni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:23">hem ka bijanel murš, hem ka vikinen le Emanuel”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7:14</ref>.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">(so značinela “O Devel amencar”).<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Koga uštilo o Josif, kergja agjar sar so phengja leske o angjeli e Gospodareskoro – hem lela e Marija romnake. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Na pipingja la sa dži kote na bijangja i Marija e čhave. Hem togaš dengja le o anav Isus.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">O mudrecija taro istok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />A koga bijandilo o Isus ko gav Vitleem ki Judeja, ko vreme dži kote carujnela sine o Irod, ale mudrecija taro istok ko Erusalim <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />hem pučle: “Kaj tano o nevo bijando caro e Evrejengoro? Dikhlem leskere čereni sar iklola ko istok hem alem te poklonina amen leske.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Koga šungja adava o car Irod, nerviringja pe, a leja hem o celo Erusalim. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Togaš vikingja sa e prvosveštenikon hem e učitelen e Zakoneskere hem pučlja len kaj trebela te bijangjovel o Hristos.<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />A ola vakerge leske: “Ko Vitleem ki Judeja, soske agjar pišingja o proroko:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Tu Vitleeme, ki phuv e Judejakiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ko ništo na sijan potikno maškar o Judejska gava</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">soske tutar ka iklol vladiteli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">kova sar pastiri ka legarel me narodo, e Izraele.’ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mih 5:2</ref>,<ref loc="MIC 5:4">4</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Togaš o Irod tajno vikingja e mudrecon hem doznangja lendar koga točno pojavingja pe i čereni. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />I bičhalgja len ko Vitleem vakerindor: “Džan hem pučljaren tumen šukar e čhaveske. Koga ka arakhen le, aven hem javinen mange te šaj me da te džav te pokloninav man leske.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ola šunge e caro hem gele. A i čereni so dikhle la sar iklola ko istok, džala sine angli lende sa dži kote na terdili upreder ko than kote so sine o čhavo. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Koga dikhle i čereni, but radujnge pe. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Hem koga khuge ko kher dikhle e čhave hem leskere daja, e Marija hem pele ko kočaka hem pokloninge pe leske. Palo adava ikalge pumare poklojna hem denge le zlato, temjan hem smirna. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Palo adava ko suno o Devel opomeningja len te na iranen pe ko Irod, hem irange pe ki pumari phuv taro javer drumo.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O našiba ko Egipet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Koga gele peske o mudrecija, o angeli e Gospodareskoro alo ko suno e Josifeske hem phengja leske: “Ušti, le e čhave hem leskere daja hem našen ko Egipet. Ačhoven adathe sa dži kote na vakerava tumenge, soske o Irod ka rodel e čhave te mudarel le.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />I o Josif uštilo, lela e čhave hem leskere daja hem ki adaja rat gelo ko Egipet. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />A adathe ačhile sa dži kote o Irod na mulo. Hem agjar pherdilo adava so phengja o Gospodari preku o proroko:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 2:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:15">“Taro Egipet vikingjum me čhave.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Os 11:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Koga o Irod svatingja deka o mudrecija hovavge le, but holangja hem naredingja e vojnikonge te džan ko Vitleem hem ko sa o pašutne thana hem te mudaren sa e tikne muršen dži ko duj berš. Sa adava kergja spored o vreme so doznangja taro mudrecija. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Togaš pherdilo adava so phengja sine o prorok Eremija:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Ko gav Rama šundilo glaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">kukjiba hem baro rojba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">a i Rahila rovela pe čhavenge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">hem na mangela te utešinel pe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">soske lakere čhave nane više dživde. ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Ere 31:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O iranibe ko Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />A palo meribe e Irodeskoro, o angeli e Gospodareskoro alo ko suno e Josifeske ko Egipet <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />hem phengja leske: “Ušti, le e čhave hem leskere daja hem džan ki phuv Izraelsko, soske mule adala so mangle te mudaren e čhave.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Ov uštilo, lela e čhave hem leskere daja hem gelo ko Izrael. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ama koga šungja deka e Irodeskoro čhavo, o Arhelaj lela o than pe dadeskoro hem ulo nevo caro ki Judeja, darandilo te džal adathe. Hem sine opomenimo ko suno te džal ki phuv Galilejsko. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />I gele hem živinge ko Nazaret. Agjar pherdilo adava so o prorokija vakerge, deka ka vikinel pe Nazarejco.<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">O Jovan Krstitel spreminela o drumo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Ko adala dive alo o Jovan Krstitel, so propovedinela sine ki Judejsko pustina <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />vakerindor: “Pokajnen tumen! Adaleske so paše tano o nebesno carstvo.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ov tano akava kastar o prorok Isaija vakergja:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 3:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Ov tano o glaso so vikinela ki pustina:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Spreminen o drumo e Gospodareskoro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">Ramnonen o drumija leskere!’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:76">Lk 1:76</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Jn 1:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />E Jovaneskere šeja sine taro bala e kamilakere, a ki kičma sine le kožno pojas, a leskoro hajbe sine skakulcija hem divo avgjin. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Togaš avena sine but manuša ki leste taro Erusalim hem tari celo Judeja hem taro sa o thana taro Jordan. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Priznajnena sine pumare grevija, hem ov krstinela len sine ki reka Jordan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Koga o Jovan dikhla bute farisejen hem sadukejen sar avena adathe kote so krstinela sine, vakergja lenge: “Tumen e sapeskere čhave! Koj vakergja tumenge te našen tari e Devleskiri holi so avela?<verse eid="MAT 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Sikaven tumare životoja deka čače pokajngjen tumen, <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />hem ma mislinen deka i dovolno te phene ki tumende: ‘O Avraam tano amaro dad.’ Adaleske vakerava tumenge o Devel šaj akale barendar te vazdel čhave e Avraameske. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Akje o tover taro sudo e Devleskoro više tano ko koreno e kašteske, hem sekova kaš so na dela šukar plodi ka ovel čhindo hem frdimo ki jag.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Me krstinava tumen pajneja bašo pokajanie. Ama pala mande avela pobaro mandar, so na sijum dostojno te phravav leskere sandale. Ov ka krstinel tumen e Sveti Duhoja hem e jagaja. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Ko leskere vasta tani i lopata, hem ka odvinel o giv taro lušpe, ka khedel po giv ki štala, hem ka tharel o lušpe jagaja so na ačhola.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Jovan krstinela e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Togaš alo o Isus tari Galileja ki reka Jordan te ovel krstimo taro Jovan.<verse eid="MAT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />A o Jovan na mangla hem phengja leske: “Tu trebela man te krstine, a tu aveja ki mande?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Ama o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Mukh akana adava. Amen trebela te kera agjar te šaj te phera celo pravda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 3:15">Togaš o Jovan složingja pe.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Samo so krstisalilo o Isus, iklilo taro pani. I taro jekh puti o nebo phravdilo hem dikhla e Devleskoro Duho sar gulubi hulela upro leste.<verse eid="MAT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Hem šundilo glaso taro nebo so vakergja: “Akava tano mo manglo Čhavo, so leste tani mi vojla.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro iskušenie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Togaš o Duho e Devleskoro legargja e Isuse ki pustina te ovel iskušimo taro Beng. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Palo saranda dive hem saranda rakja posti, o Isus bokhalilo.<verse eid="MAT 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />I alo ki leste o Beng so iskušinela hem phengja leske: “Te sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro, vaker akale barenge te oven mare.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “Pišimo i:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 4:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">‘O manuš nane te živinel samo taro maro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:4">nego taro sekova jekh lafi so iklola taro muj e Devleskoro.’ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">PZ 8:3</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Palo adava o Beng legargja le ko Sveto gradi Erusalim hem čhigja le ko najučo than e Hrameskoro <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />hem phengja leske: “Te sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro, frde tut akatar tele. Soske pišimo i:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 4:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Ka zapovedinel pe angelenge te arakhen tut</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">te ikeren tut ko vasta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">te na khuve to pro ko bar.’ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Ps 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Pišimo i hem akava: ‘Ma iskušin e Gospodare, te Devle.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">PZ 6:16</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Togaš o Beng legargja le ki but uči planina hem sikavgja leske sa o carstvija e svetoskere hem lengiri slava <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />hem phengja leske: “Sa akava ka dav tut, ako pelan ko kočaka hem pokloningjan tut mange.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />O Isus phengja leske: “Cide tut mandar, Benga! Soske pišimo i:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 4:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">‘Poklonin tut e Gospodareske, te Devleske, hem samo leske služin.’ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">PZ 6:13</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Togaš o Beng cidingja pe lestar, a o angejla ale hem služinge leske.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus počmingja te propovedinel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Koga o Isus šungja deka o Jovan Kristitel tano ko zatvor, gelo ki Galileja. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Mukhla o Nazaret hem gelo te živinel ko Kapernaum, uza ko Galilejsko ezero, ko thana taro pleme e Zavuloneskoro hem e Neftalimeskoro, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />te šaj te phergjol adava so phengja o prorok Isaija:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Ki phuv e Zavuloneskiri hem e Neftalimeskiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">uza ko ezero Galilejsko, tari javer strana tari reka Jordan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">ki Galileja ki phuv e javere nacije,<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />o manuša so živinena ki temnina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">dikhle i bari svetlina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">ali i svetlina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">okolenge da so živinena ki senka e meribaskiri.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Isa 9:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Taro adava vreme o Isus počmingja te propovedinel: “Pokajnen tumen! Adaleske so paše tano o nebesno carstvo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vikinela e prvo učenikon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Dži kote nakhela sine o Isus uza ko ezero Galilejsko, dikhla e duje phralen, e Simone vikimo Petar hem e Andreja, sar frdena o mreže ko pani, adaleske so ola sine ribajra.<verse eid="MAT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Hem phengja lenge: “Aven pala mande hem me ka kerav tumen te astare manušen mesto mačhen.”<verse eid="MAT 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ola odma mukhle pumare mreže hem gele pala leste.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Koga gele adathar hari podur, o Isus dikhla panda duje phralen, e Jakove hem e Jovane, sar pumare dadeja e Zavedeje bešena ko čamco hem namestinena sine pumare mreže. O Isus len da vikingja. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Hem ola odma mukhle o čamco hem pumare dade hem gele pala leste.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela e nasvalen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />O Isus džala sine ki celo Galileja hem sikavela sine e manušen ko lengere sinagoge, propovedindor o evangelije taro nebesno carstvo hem sasljarela sine sekova nasvalipe hem slabost maškar o manuša.<verse eid="MAT 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />A baši leske šundilo ki celo Sirija, hem o manuša ange ki leste sa e nasvalen taro različno nasvalipe, adala so mučinena pe sine jako dukhencar, opsednime taro demojna, okola so sine len epilepsija hem so sine sakatija. A o Isus sasljarela len sine. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Hem pala leste džana sine but manuša tari Galileja, taro Dekapolis, taro Erusalim, tari Judeja, hem tari javer strana tari reka Jordan.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">I propoved ki gora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Koga o Isus dikhla but narodo, uklilo upre ki gora hem adathe bešla te sikavel. A leskere učenikija ale ki leste.<verse eid="MAT 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Ov počmingja te sikavel len, vakerindor:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Blagoslovime tane o čorole ko duho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">soske lengoro tano o carstvo nebesno.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Blagoslovime tane okola so tugujnena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">soske ola ka oven utešime.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Blagoslovime tane o krotka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">soske ola ka nasledinen i phuv.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Blagoslovime tane o bokhale hem o žedna baši pravda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">soske ola ka čajloven.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Blagoslovime tane o milostliva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">soske lenge ka sikavel pe milost.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Blagoslovime tane o čista ko srce,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">soske ola ka dikhen e Devle.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Blagoslovime tane okola so anena mir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">soske ola ka vikinen pe čhave e Devleskere.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Blagoslovime tane okola soj progonime baši pravda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">soske lengoro tano o carstvo nebesno.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Blagoslovime sijen tumen koga o manuša uvredžinena hem progoninena tumen, vakerindor protiv tumende razno lošnipe hovajbe baši mange. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Radujnen tumen hem veselinen tumen! Adaleske so bari tani tumari nagrada ko nebo, soske agjar e prorokon da progoninge so sine angleder tumende.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O lon hem i svetlina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Tumen sijen o lon ki phuv. Ama ako o lon našagja po vkus, sar šaj palem te ovel londalo? Više ništoske nane šukar, osven te frdel pe hem te ovel gazimo prencar.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Tumen sijen i svetlina ko sveto. Našti te ovel garavdo o gradi soj upre ki planina. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Nikoj na tharela momoli te učharel la čareja, nego na čhivena la li ko lakoro than te svetinel sarinenge ko kher. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Agjar, neka svetinel tumari svetlina anglo sarine, te šaj te dikhen tumare šukar dejla hem te slavinen tumare Dade soj ko nebo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o Zakoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Ma mislinen deka me alum te čhinavav e Mojseskoro Zakoni ili o lila e Prorokongere. Na alum te čhinavav len, nego te pherav len. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Soske čače vakerava tumenge, sa dži kote postojnela o nebo hem phuv, nane nijekh tikni bukva te našavgjovel ili crtička taro Zakoni nane te meningjovel, sa dži kote na phergjola sa! <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Adaleske, koj ka mukhel jekh taro akala najtikne zapovedija hem ka sikavel javeren te keren agjar, ka ovel najtikno ko carstvo nebesno. Ama koj ka ikerel hem ka sikavel sa akala zapovedija, ka ovel baro ko carstvo nebesno. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Soske vakerava tumenge deka ako tumari pravednost na nakhagja okoja e farisejengiri hem učitelengiri e Zakonestar, našti nisar te khuven ko carstvo nebesno.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baši holi hem o mir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Šungjen so sine phendo ko Zakoni amare parapapongoro: ‘Ma mudar! A koj ka mudarela ka ovel osudimo anglo sudo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ama, me vakerava tumenge: Koj ka holanel pe phraleske ka ovel osudimo anglo sudo. A koj ka vikinel pe phrale ‘glupavo’ ka ovel osudimo anglo pobaro sudo. A te vikingja le ‘dilineja’ ka ovel osudimo bašo jagakoro pekol.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Adaleske, ako aneja žrtva anglo oltari hem adathe setineja tut deka isi le nešto te phrale protiv tute, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />mukh ti žrtva anglo oltari, prvo dža hem smirin tut leja. Togaš ava hem de ti žrtva.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Posigate dža hem smirin tut te dušmaneja. Ker adava sa dži kote sijan ko drumo sar na gelo dži ko sudija te del tut, ili to dušmani ka del tut ko sudija, a o sudija ka del tut e čuvareske so ka čhivel tut ko zatvor. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Čače vakerava tuke, nane te iklove adathar sa dži kote na deja te posledna pare.”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baši preljuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Šungjen so sine phendo ko Zakoni: ‘Ma ker preljuba!’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ama, me vakerava tumenge: Sekoj so ka dikhel ki džuvli želbaja, više kergja preljuba laja ko po srce. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ako ti desno jakh čhivela tut ko grevo, ikav la hem frde la tutar. Pošukar i te našave jekh delo taro to telo, nego celo telo te ovel frdimo ko pekol. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Ako to desno vas čhivela tut ko grevo, čhin le hem frde le tutar. Pošukar i te našave jekh delo taro to telo, nego celo telo te džal ko pekol.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo razvod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Isto agjar sine phendo: ‘Sekoj so ka mukhel pe romna, neka dela la razvodno lil.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ama vakerava tumenge deka sekoj so mukhel pe romna, osven baši preljuba, ov agjar čhivela la te kerel preljuba. Hem koj ka lel mukhle romna taro rom, ov da kerela preljuba.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baši sovli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Isto agjar šungjen so sine phendo ko Zakoni amare parapapongoro: ‘Ma ha sovli hovavni, nego ker i sovli so dengjan la anglo Gospodari.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ama, me vakerava tumenge: Ma ha sovli nigde, ni ko nebo, soske adavaj e Devleskoro troni, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />ni ki phuv, soske adathe tane leskere pre, ni ko Erusalim, soske adava tano o gradi e Devleskoro, e bare careskoro. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Ma ha sovli ni ko to šero, soske našti te keren nijekh bal parni ili kali. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ama tumaro lafi neka ovel: ‘Oja’ ‘oja’ ili ‘Na’ ‘na’ a sa soj poviše adalestar i tano e lošnostar.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baši odmazda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Šungjen so sine phendo: ‘Jakh baši jakh, dand bašo dand!’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ama, me vakerava tumenge: Ma protivinen tumen e lošno manušeja. Ako nekoj khugja tut šamarka ki desno čham, iran leske okoja da čham. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Ako nekoj mangela te sudinel tut hem te lel to gad, de le hem o mantili. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Ako čhivena tut o Rimska vojnikija te legare lengere bukja jekh kilometar, tu legar duj. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />De okole so rodela tutar, hem ma odbin okole so mangela te lel tutar zaem.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mang te dušmane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Šungjen so sine phendo: ‘Mang te pašutne’, a ‘mrzin te dušmane.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ama, me vakerava tumenge: Mangen tumare dušmanen hem molinen tumen okolenge so progoninena tumen, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />te šaj ovena čhave tumare Dadeske soj ko nebo. Ov kerela leskoro kham te thablol e lošnonge da hem e šukarenge da, hem mukhela bršim upro pravednikija hem upro grešnikija. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ako mangena samo okolen so mangena tumen, savi nagrada ka dobinen? Na kerena li adava o danočnikija? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ako pozdravinena tumen samo tumare manušencar, so sijan pošukar javerendar? Na kerena li isto adava o manuša so na džanena e Devle? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Adaleske oven sovršena sar soj sovršeno tumaro Dad soj ko nebo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bašo dejba e čorolenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />O Isus phengja: “Pazinen! Ma keren šukaripe anglo manuša te šaj te dikhen tumen javera, soske ako kergjen adava, nane te ovel tumen nagrada taro tumaro Dad soj ko nebo.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Hem agjar koga deja e čorolenge, ma vaker adava javno, sar so kerena o dujmujale ko sinagoge hem ko ulice, te šaj te poštojnen len sarinen. Čače vakerava tumenge, ola dobinge više pi nagrada. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />A koga deja e čorolenge, ma te džanel to levo vas so kerela to desno. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Hem de e čorolenge tajno, a to Dad, so dikhela soj kerdo tajno, ka nagradinel tut.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I molitva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Hem koga molinena tumen ma oven sar o dujmujale, soske ola mangena te molinen pe ko sinagoge hem ko ploštadija, te šaj te dikhen len o manuša. Čače vakerava tumenge ola dobinge više pi nagrada. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ama tu, koga molineja tut, khuv ki ti soba korkori, phan o udara hem molin tut te Dadeske e Devleske soj tano ko tajnost, a to Dad, so dikhela soj kerdo tajno, ka nagradinel tut. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Hem koga molinena tumen, ma vakeren but čuče lafija sar okola so na džanena e Devle, soske ola mislinena deka ka oven šunde ako vakerge but lafija. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Adaleske ma oven sar lende, soske tumaro Dad džanela so trebela tumenge, angleder te roden lestar. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Adaleske agjar molinen tumen:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 6:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Dade amareja, so sijan ko nebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">neka ovel sveto to anav,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />te avel to carstvo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">neka ovel ti vojla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">sar ko nebo agjar ki phuv.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Amaro šuko maro de amen avdive,<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />hem oprostin amare grevija sar so amen oprostinaja okolenge so grešinena amenge.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Cide amen taro iskušenie, hem arakh amen taro Beng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Soske to carstvo, ti sila ti slava ko sa o vekija. Amin.]’<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Soske ako oprostingjen javerenge koga ka grešinen tumenge, agjar tumaro Dad soj ko nebo, ka oprostinel tumenge. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Ama ako na oprostingjen javerenge, ni tumaro Dad nane te oprostinel tumenge tumare grevija.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo posti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Koga postinena, ma mukhen tumaro muj sar o dujmujale, soske ola kerena adava te šaj te dikhen len o manuša deka postinena. Čače vakerava tumenge, ola dobinge više pi nagrada. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ama tu koga postineja, thov to muj hem harav te bala, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />te na dikhen tut o manuša deka postineja, nego samo to Dad soj ko tajnost. Togaš to Dad so dikhela so kerela pe ko tajnost ka nagradinel tut.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo barvalipe ko nebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Ma kheden tumenge barvalipe ki phuv, kote so o insektija hem i rgja ka uništinen le, hem kote so čora khuvena hem čorena le. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Nego kheden tumenge barvalipe ko nebo, kote so o insektija hem i rgja na uništinela le, a ni o čora našti te aven hem te čoren le. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Soske kaj tano to barvalipe, adathe ka ovel to srce da.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />I jakh tani svetlina te teloske. Ako te jakha tane saste, celo to telo ka ovel pherdo svetlinaja. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Ama ako ti jakh tani lošno, celo to telo ka ovel pherdo temninaja. Togaš ako i svetlina ki tute tani temnina, kozom pobari ka ovel adaja temnina!”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Našti služinela e Devleske hem e parenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Nikoj našti te služinel duje gospodarenge. Ili jekhe ka mrzinel, a okole ka mangel, ili jekheske ka ovel poslušno, a e dujtone nane te podnesinel. Našti služinena hem e Devleske hem e parenge.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo sekiracije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Adaleske vakerava tumenge: Ma sekirinen tumen bašo tumaro životo, so ka han hem so ka pijen, ili so ka phiravel tumaro telo. Nane li o životo považno taro hajbe, a o telo považno taro šeja? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Dikhen e čiriklen. Ola ni sejnena, ni na khedena te čhiven ki štala. A palem parvarela len tumaro Dad soj ko nebo. A na sijen li tumen považno lendar? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />A šaj li nekoj tumendar sekirindor te prodolžinel hari po životo?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Hem soske sekirinena tumen šejenge? Dikhen sar bajrona o lulugja ko pole. Ni mučinena pe, ni na sivena peske šeja. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />A vakerava tumenge ni o car Solomon, so sine but barvalo, na sine uravdo agjar, sar jekh lendar. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ako o Devel agjar uravela o pole e lulugjencar, so avdive tane adathe, a tajsa frdela pe ki jag, kozom poviše šeja ka del pe tumenge tikne verakere? <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Adaleske ma sekirinen tumen hem ma vakeren: ‘So ka ha?’ ili ‘So ka pija?’ ili ‘So ka urava?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Soske sa akava rodena okola so na džanena e Devle. A tumaro Dad soj upre ko nebo džanela so trebela tumen. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ama najanglal roden o carstvo e Devleskoro hem leskiri pravda, i sa akava ka del pe tumenge.<verse eid="MAT 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Adaleske, ma sekirinen tumen bašo tajsutno dive, soske o tajsutno dive ka sekirinel pe peske. Sekova dive isi le dovolno pe problemija.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ma sudinen javeren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Ma sudinen! Hem nane te sudinel pe tumenge. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Soske, sar ka sudinen javeren, agjar ka oven sudime tumen, hem save merkaja ka merinen, asavke merkaja ka merinel pe tumenge.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Soske dikheja i delanka te phraleske ki jakh, a i greda ki ti jakh na dikheja? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Sar šaj te vakere te phraleske: ‘Ač te ikalav i delanka tari ti jakh,’ koga ki ti jakh isi greda? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Dujmujaleja! Prvo ikal i greda tari ti jakh, a poslem ka dikhe šukar sar te ikale i delanka tari jakh te phraleskiri.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Ma den e džukelenge adava soj sveto, hem ma frden tumare bisejra e balenge. Ako kergjen adava, o bale šaj te gazinen len, a o džukela te irange pe ka keren tumen ko kotora.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pučen, roden, khuven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Pučen hem ka del pe tumenge; roden hem ka arakhen; khuven hem ka phravel pe tumenge. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Soske sekoj so pučela, dobinela; hem koj rodela, arakhela; a koj khuvela, ka phravel pe leske.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Koj tumendar, ako rodingja leskoro čhavo maro, ka del le bar? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ili ako rodingja mačho, ka del le sap? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Togaš, tumen so sijen lošna, džanena te den šukar poklojna tumare čhavenge, a kozom poviše tumaro Dad soj ko nebo ka del šuže poklojna okolenge so rodena lestar.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Hem agjar, ko sa, keren tumen adava so mangena te keren tumenge javera; soske akava pherela o Zakoni hem o lila e Prorokongere.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O tesno hem o buvlo udar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Khuven taro tesno udar. Soske buvle tane o udara hem buvle tane o drumija so legarena ko propast, hem but džene khuvena lestar. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ama but i tikne o udara hem tesna o drumija so legarena ko životo, a samo hari džene arakhena le.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O čačutne hem o hovavne prorokija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Arakhen tumen taro hovavne prorokija. Ola avena ki tumende ki bakhrani koza, ama andral tane diva ruva. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Taro lengere plodija ka pendžaren len. Dali šaj o manuša te kheden drakha taro kare, ili smokve taro bocke? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Agjar, sekova šukar kaš dela šukar plodija, a o lošno kaš dela lošna plodija. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />O šukar kaš našti te del lošna plodija, ni o lošno kaš našti te del šukar plodija. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Sekova kaš so na dela šukar plodi činela pe hem frdela pe ki jag. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Agjar, taro lengere plodija ka pendžaren e hovavne prorokon.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nikat na pendžargjum tumen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Na sekoj so ka vakerel: ‘Gospode, Gospode’, ka khuven ko nebesno carstvo, nego okova so kerela i vojla me Dadeskiri soj ko nebo. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />But džene ka vakeren ko sudno dive: ‘Gospode, Gospode, na prorokujngjem li ko to anav? Hem na ikalgjem li demonen ko to anav? Hem na kergjem li but čudija ko to anav?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Hem togaš me ka phenav lenge: ‘Nikat na pendžargjum tumen. Našen mandar dur, tumen so phagena o Zakoni e Devleskoro!’”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O pametno hem o našavdo manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“I sekoj so šunela me lafija hem so pherela len, ov tano sar pametno manuš, so kergja po kher ki karpa. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Hem dengja bršim, ale poplave hem phudingja bavlal ko adava kher, ama o kher na pelo, soske sine kerdo ki karpa. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Ama sekoj so šunela me lafija hem na pherela len, ov tano sar našavdo manuš, so kergja po kher ki pošik. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Hem dengja bršim, ale poplave hem phudingja bavlal ko adava kher hem celo kher rušisalilo!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Koga o Isus završingja akale lafencar, o manuša sine čudime taro leskoro učibe, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />soske ov sikavela len sine sar adava so isi le vlast, a na sar o učitejla e Zakoneskere.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela leprozno manuše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Koga o Isus hulilo tari planina, pala leste džana sine but manuša. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Taro jekh puti alo jekh manuš so sine le lepra, pelo ko kočaka anglo leste hem phengja: “Gospode, te manglan šaj sasljareja man.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />O Isus pružingja po vas, pipingja le hem phengja: “Mangava! Saslov!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:3">I odma saslilo tari lepra.<verse eid="MAT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Togaš o Isus vakergja leske: “Ma vaker nikaske, samo dža hem sikav tut e sveštenikoske hem de žrtva sar so naredingja o Mojsej, te šaj te ovel svedoštvo lenge.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Rimsko kapetaneskiri vera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Koga o Isus khugja ko Kapernaum, alo ki leste jekh Rimsko kapetani hem rodingja lestar te pomožinel le <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />vakerindor: “Gospode, mo sluga pašlola khere sakati hem but mučinela pe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />O Isus phengja leske: “Ka avav hem ka sasljarav le.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />A o kapetani phengja leske: “Gospode, na zaslužinava te ave me khereste. Ama vaker samo jekh lafi hem mo sluga ka ovel sasto. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Soske me da sijum manuš telo avtoriteti hem isi man vojnikija teli mande. Koga phenava jekheske: ‘Dža’ – ov džala. A javereske: ‘Ava’ – ov avela. Hem vakerava me slugaske: ‘Ker akava’ – ov kerela.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Koga šungja adava o Isus, čudingja pe hem vakergja okolenge so džana sine pala leste: “Čače vakerava tumenge, na arakhlum nikas ko Izrael, te ovel le doborom vera. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />A vakerava tumenge deka but džene ka aven taro istok hem taro zapad hem ka len than te han e Avraameja, e Isakoja hem e Jakoveja ko carstvo nebesno. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />A okolenge so trebingja te del pe o carstvo ka oven frdime avrik ko najtemno than, kote so ka ovel rojba hem krckjiba dandencar.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Togaš o Isus phengja e kapetaneske: “Dža! Neka ovel agjar sar so verujngjan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">I ko adava momenti leskoro sluga saslilo.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela bute manuše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Koga alo o Isus ko kher e Petareske, dikhla leskere sasa, sar pašlola ko kreveti hem sine la bari treska. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Ov astargja lakoro vas hem i treska mukhla la, i oj uštili hem počmingja te služinel len.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Koga rakjilo, ange ki leste bute manušen so sine opsednime taro demojna hem ov lafeja ikalela sine e duhon hem sasljargja sa e nasvalen. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Agjar pherdilo adava so sine phendo preku o prorok Isaija:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 8:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">“Ov lela amare slabostija</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">hem phiragja amaro nasvalipe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nane lokho te ovel e Isuseskoro učeniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Koga o Isus dikhla i gužva uza peste, zapovedingja pe učenikonge te nakhen tari javer strana taro ezero.<verse eid="MAT 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Togaš alo ki leste jekh učiteli e Zakoneskoro hem phengja: “Učitele, ka avav pala tute, kaj i te dža.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />I o Isus phengja leske: “E lisicen isi len pe thana kaj te soven hem e čiriklen gnezdija, ama o Čhavo Manušeskoro nane kaj te čhivel po šero.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />A o javer učeniko vakergja leske: “Gospode ač te parunav prvo me dade.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Ama o Isus vakergja leske: “Ava pala mande hem mukh e mulen te parunen pe mulen.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus smirinela i bura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Togaš o Isus khugja ko čamco, a pala leste khuge hem leskere učenikija. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />I taro jekh puti ko ezero astargja len bari bura, adaleja so o čamco počmingja te phergjol pani taro talasija, a o Isus sovela sine.<verse eid="MAT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />O učenikija gele hem vazdinge le, vakerindor: “Gospode, spasin amen! Ka taslova!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />O Isus pučlja len: “Tikne verakere, soske doborom darana?” Togaš uštilo, zapovedingja e bavlalake hem e ezeroske te ačhon, i uli bari tišina.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />A o manuša čudisalile hem pučle: “Koj akava so i bavlal da hem o talasija da šunena le?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ikalela e demonen taro duj manuša</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />I koga resla ki javer strana taro ezero, ko thana tari Gadarinsko phuv, iklile anglo leste duj manuša so sine opsednime demonencar so avena sine taro grobija. Doborom sine zorale so nikoj našti sine te nakhel adale drumostar.<verse eid="MAT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Taro jekh puti vikinge: “So mangeja amendar, Čhavo e Devleskoro? Akarik li alan te mučine amen angleder o vreme?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />A podur lendar sine jekh baro stado taro bale so hana sine.<verse eid="MAT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />A o demojna molinge e Isuse: “Ako ikaleja amen, bičhav amen ko okova stado taro bale.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Ov phengja lenge: “Džan!” Ola iklile e duje manušendar hem khuge ko bale. I sa o bale prastandile taro brego ko ezero hem mule ko pani.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />A okola so arakhena sine e balen, našle hem gele ko gradi te vakeren sa so ulo, hem adava so ulo e manušencar so sine opsednime.<verse eid="MAT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Togaš sa o manuša taro gradi ale te dikhen e Isuse. I koga dikhle le molinge le te džal peske taro lengoro than.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus oprostinela hem sasljarela e sakate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />O Isus uklilo ko čamco, nakhla tari javer strana taro ezero hem alo ko po gradi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Nesave manuša ange ki leste jekhe sakate manuše, pašlo ki postela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:2">Koga dikhla o Isus lengiri vera, vakergja e sakateske: “Ma dara mo čhavo, oprostime tane te grevija.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Togaš nesave učitejla e Zakoneskere vakerge ki peste: “Akava hulinela!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />A o Isus džangja so mislinena, i pučlja len: “Soske agjar mislinena lošno ko tumare srcija? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Soj polokhe te vakerel pe: ‘Oprostime tane te grevija’, ili te vakerav leske: ‘Ušti hem phir’? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ama ka dokažinav tumenge deka o Čhavo Manušeskoro isi le vlast ki phuv te oprostinel grevija.” Togaš phengja e sakateske: “Ušti! Le ti postela hem dža tuke khere.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Ov uštilo hem gelo peske khere.<verse eid="MAT 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Koga o narodo dikhle adava, čudisalile hem slavinge e Devle, adaleske so dengja asavki vlast e manušen.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vikinela e Mateje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Koga o Isus gelo adathar, dikhla jekhe manuše so vikinela pe sine Matej sar bešela sine ko than kote so khedela pe danok hem phengja leske: “Ava pala mande!” O Matej uštilo hem gelo pala leste.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />A dži kote o Isus hala sine ki sofra ko kher e Matejeskoro, ale but danočnikija hem javera grešnikija hem hana sine leja hem leskere učenikoncar.<verse eid="MAT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Koga dikhle o fariseja adava, pučle leskere učenikon: “Soske tumaro učiteli hala hem pijela e danočnikoncar hem javere grešnikoncar?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Koga šungja akava o Isus, odgovoringja lenge: “E sastenge na trebela doktori, nego e nasvalenge. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Ama džan hem sikloven so značinela akava: ‘Milost mangava, a na samo žrtva.’ Soske na alum e pravednikon te vikinav, nego e grešnikon.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuse pučena bašo posti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Togaš ale e Jovaneskere učenikija hem pučle le: “Soske amen hem o fariseja poviše puti postinaja, a te učenikija na postinena?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Sar šaj o henamika te roven dži kote o džamutro tano lencar? Ama ka avel dive, koga ka ovel lelo o džamutro lendar, i togaš ola ka postinen.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Nikoj na sivela nevi krpa ko purano gad, soske ko thojbe ka otkačingjovel o nevo taro purano, hem o otvor ka ovel pobaro. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Ni na čhorela pe nevi mol ko purane mevija<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mevija </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mevovi sine kerde tari zivotinegiri koža kote so koristinena sine sar fučija.</char></note>. Ako kerge adava, koga i mol ka reslol o mevija ka phajron; i mol ka čhorgol, hem o mevija ka rumingjoven. Nego o nevo mol čhivela pe ko neve mevija, i o solduj ka oven arakhle.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vazdela e čhaja taro mule hem sasljarela e nasvale romna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Dži kote o Isus vakerela sine akava, alo jekh vodači tari sinagoga, pelo ko kočaka anglo leste hem vakergja leske: “Mi čhaj samo so muli. Ama ava hem čhiv to vas upro late, hem oj ka ovel dživdi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />O Isus uštilo hem zaedno pe učenikoncar gelo pala leste. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ko adava momenti ali pala leste jekh romni so dešuduj berš thavdela sine latar rat. I pipingja le ko krajo taro leskere šeja. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Soske oj phengja ki peste: “Samo te pipinav man ko leskere šeja, ka sasljovav.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />O Isus irangja pe, dikhla la hem phengja lake: “Ma dara, mi čhaj, ti vera sasljargja tut.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:22">Hem i romni ko adava momenti saslili.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Koga o Isus khugja ko kher e vodačeskoro tari sinagoga, dikhla e manušen so bašalena sine flejta baši muli čhaj hem bute manušen so rovena, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />i vakergja lenge: “Džan tumenge! I čhaj na muli, oj sovela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:24">A ola asandile leske.<verse eid="MAT 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Koga o manuša iklile avrik, o Isus khugja kote so sine i čhaj, astargja lakoro vas hem oj uštili. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Hem šundilo adava ko celo adava than.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela e korolen hem e kašuken</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Koga o Isus džala peske sine adathar, duj korole manuša džana sine pala leste, vikindor: “Žalin amen, Čhavo e Davideskoro!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Koga khugja ko kher, o korole manuša ale ki leste, hem ov pučlja len: “Verujnena li deka šaj te kerav adava?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Ola odgovoringe: “Oja, Gospode.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Togaš pipingja lengere jakha hem phengja: “Neka ovel spored tumari vera.”<verse eid="MAT 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Hem irasalilo lengoro dikhibe. A o Isus silno opomeningja len vakerindor: “Nikoj ma te džanel bašo akava.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ama ola iklile hem vakerge bašo akava sarinenge ko adava than.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Dži kote ola iklona sine, ko Isus sine ando jekh manuš so sine opsednimo taro demojna hem našti sine te kerel lafi. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Koga o Isus ikalgja lestar e demone, o manuš kerela sine lafi. A o manuša čudinge pe hem vakerge: “Nikat asavko nešto na dikhlem ko Izrael!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />A o fariseja vakerena sine: “Ov ikalela e demonen, preku o gospodari e demonengoro.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I žetva tani bari ama rabotnikija isi hari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />O Isus džala sine ko sa o gradija hem ko sa o gava, sikavela sine ko lengere sinagoge, propovedindor o evangelije bašo carstvo hem sasljarela sine razno nasvalipe hem slabost. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Koga dikhla bute narodon, pelo leske žal baši lenge, soske sine but mučime hem bizo pomoš, sar bakhre bizo pastiri.<verse eid="MAT 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Togaš vakergja pe učenikonge: “I žetva tani bari ama rabotnikija isi hari. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Adaleske, molinen tumare Gospodare e žetvakoro te bičhavel rabotnikija ki pi niva baši žetva.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus bičhavela e dešudujen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />O Isus vikingja pe dešuduje učenikon hem dengja len avtoriteti te ikalen lošna duhija hem te sasljaren sekova nasvalipe hem slabost. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />A akala tane o anava e dešuduje apostolengere:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 10:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:2">o prvo Simon (so vikinela pe Petar) hem leskoro phral Andrej;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:2">o Jakov o čhavo e Zavedejeskoro, hem leskoro phral o Jovan;<verse eid="MAT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />o Filip hem o Vartelomej;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:3">o Toma hem o Matej o danočniko;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:3">o Jakov, o čhavo e Alfejeskoro hem o Tadej;<verse eid="MAT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />o Simon Kananiec hem o Juda Iskariot so predajngja e Isuse.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />O Isus bičhalgja akale dešudujen vakerindor: “Ma džan maškar o manuša so nane Evreja hem ma khuven ko nesavo gradi e Samarijengoro. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ama najanglal džan ko našavde bakhre e Izraeleskere. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Dži kote džana vakeren akava: ‘Alo paše o carstvo nebesno.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Sasljaren e nasvalen, vazden e mulen, sasljaren adalen so isi len lepra, ikalen e demonen. Bizo pare dobingjen, bizo pare den. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Ma len tumencar ni zlato, ni srebro, ni bakri ko tumare pojasija, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />ni torba drumoske, ni javer gad, ni javera sandale, ni kaš phiribaske. Soske o rabotniko zaslužinela pi plata.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Ko kova gradi ili gav ka khuven, roden adathe nesave manuše soj tano dostojno hem ačhoven leste ko kher, sa dži kote na džana tumenge taro adava than. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />I koga ka khuven ko adava kher, vakeren: ‘Mir tumencar.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Hem te priminge tumen, neka ačhol tumaro mir lencar. A te na priminge tumen, tumaro mir neka iranel pe tumende. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ako nekoj na primingja tumen ili na mangla te šunel tumare lafija, ikloven taro adava kher ili taro adava gradi hem tresinen i prašina taro tumare pre sar znako deka nane tumen ništo lencar. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Čače phenava tumenge, polokhe ka ovel bašo Sodom hem i Gomora ko sudno dive nego adale gradeske.”<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo progoniba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Akje, bičhavava tumen sar bakhre maškar o ruva. Adaleske oven mudra sar o sapa hem mirna sar o gulubija. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Pazinen tumen, soske ka oven predajme ko sudo hem ka kamšikujnen tumen ko sinagoge. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Baši mange ka anen tumen anglo vlastija hem cajra sar svedokija lenge hem e manušenge so nane Evreja. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ama koga ka astaren tumen ma sekirinen tumen so ka phenen ili sar ka vakeren. Ko adava vreme ka del pe tumenge so te vakeren, <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />soske nane tumen te vakeren, nego o Duho tumare Dadeskoro ka kerel lafi preku tumende.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />O phral pe phrale ka predajnel ko meriba, a o dad pe čhave. O čhave ka oven protiv pumare roditejla, hem ka predajnen len ko meriba. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Sarine ka mrzinen tumen baši mange, ama adava so ka ačhol verno dži ko krajo ka ovel spasimo. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Koga ka progoninen tumen ko jekh than, našen ko javer. Čače phenava tumenge, nane te resen te nakhaven sa o gradija taro Izrael angleder o Čhavo Manušeskoro te avel.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Nane učeniko pobaro taro po učiteli, ni o sluga pobaro taro po gospodari. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Dovolno i e učenikoske te ovel sar po učiteli, a o sluga te ovel sar po gospodari. Ako o gazda e khereskoro vikimo Veelzevul – o Beng – kozom poviše leskere kherutnen ka vikinen agjar!”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma daran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Adaleske, ma daran lendar, soske sa soj garavdo ka dikhol javno hem sa soj tajno, ka šungjol. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Adava so phenava tumenge ki temnina, vakeren le ki svetlina; hem adava so pohari phenela pe tumenge ko kan, vakeren le taro krovi sarinen te šunen le.<verse eid="MAT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Ma daran okolendar so šaj mudarena o telo, a našti mudarena i duša. Ama daran okolestar so šaj uništinela hem i duša hem o telo ko pekol. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Na bikinela pe li duj čirikla jekhe dinareske. Ama nijekh lendar nane te perel ki phuv, bizi vojla tumare Dadeskiri. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />A tumenge ko šero sekoj bal tani gejmi. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Adaleske, ma daran; tumen sijen povredna taro but čirikla.”<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma ladža taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Koj ka priznajnel deka tano mlo anglo manuša, me da ka priznajnav le deka tano mlo anglo mo Dad soj ko nebo. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Ama koj ka otkažinel pe mandar anglo manuša, me da ka otkažinav man lestar anglo mo Dad soj ko nebo.”<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Na mir nego čhurik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Ma mislinen deka alum te anav mir ki phuv. Na alum te anav mir, nego čhurik. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Alum te odvinav:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 10:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">‘e čhave leskere dadestar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">e čhaja lakere dajatar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">e bojra lakere sasatar.<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />O dušmajna e manušeskere ka oven leskere kherutne.’<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Sekoj so mangela pe dade ili pe daja poviše mandar, nane dostojno te ovel mo učeniko. Sekoj so mangela pe čhave ili pe čhaja poviše mandar, nane dostojno te ovel mo učeniko. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Koj na lela po krsto hem na džala pala mande, nane dostojno te ovel mo učeniko. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Koj ka arakhel po životo ka našavel le, a koj ka našavel po životo baši mange ka arakhel le.”<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O nagrade e učenikongere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Koj priminela tumen, priminela man, a koj priminela man, priminela okole so bičhalgja man. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Koj ka priminel proroko, adaleske soj proroko, ka dobinel proročko nagrada, a koj ka priminel pravedniko, adaleske soj pravedniko, ka dobinel nagrada taro pravedniko. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Hem ako nekoj dela jekheske akale tiknendar te pijel jekh čaša šudro pani, adaleske soj mo učeniko, čače vakerava tumenge, adava manuš nane te našavel pi nagrada.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o Jovan Krstitel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />O Isus koga završingja o učibe pe dešuduje učenikoncar, gelo adathar te sikavel hem te propovedinel ko gradija e Galilejakere.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Koga o Jovan Krstitel, so sine ko zatvor, šungja bašo dejla e Hristoskere, bičhalgja pe učenikon <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />te pučen e Isuse: “Tu li sijan adava so trebela te avel ili te adžikera javere?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Džan hem vakeren e Jovaneske so šunena hem so dikhena: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />o korole dikhena, o bange phirena, okolen so isi len lepra sasljona, o kašuke šunena, o mule uštena, hem o evangelije propovedinela pe e čorolenge. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Hem blagoslovimo tano sekoj so na otkažinela pe mandar.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />A koga gele peske e Jovaneskere učenikija, o Isus počmingja te vakerel e manušenge bašo Jovan: “So iklilen te dikhen ki pustina? I trska li so phudela la i bavlal? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ako na, so iklilen te dikhen? Manuš uravdo ko šuže šeja? Na, okola so phiravena šuže šeja tane ko carska palate. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Togaš so iklilen te dikhen? E proroko li? Oja, vakerava tumenge, ov tano poviše taro proroko. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ov tano akava baši kaske sine pišimo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 11:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">‘Akje, me bičhavava me glasniko angla tute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">so ka spreminel to drumo angla tute.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Čače vakerava tumenge, maškar sa o manuša soj bijame nijekh nane pobaro taro Jovan Krstitel, ama sekoj soj najtikno ko carstvo nebesno tano pobaro lestar. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Taro dive e Jovane Krstiteleskoro koga počmingja te propovedinel dži akana, o carstvo nebesno cidela muka, hem o siladžije lena le silaja. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Soske sa o prorokija hem o Zakoni prorokujnge dži ko Jovan. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Te manglen te prifatinen, ov tano o Ilija so trebela sine te avel. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Kas isi kana, neka šunel.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Soleja te sporedinav akaja generacija? Ola tane sar čhave so bešena ko pazajra hem vakerena javerenge:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Bašalgjem tumenge ki flejta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">a na khelgjen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">Gilagjem tumenge tažna gijla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">a na rungjen.’<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Soske koga alo o Jovan, ni hala ni pila sar javera, a ola vakerena: ‘Isi le demoni.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Alo o Čhavo Manušeskoro, hala hem pijela, a ola vakerena: ‘Akje o bokhalo hem o pijanica, amal e danočnikongoro hem javere grešnikongoro.’ Ama i mudrost dokažinela pe deloncar.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ukorinela o grešna gradija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Togaš o Isus počmingja te ukorinel o gradija so ki lende kergja but čudija, soske ola na pokajnge pe.<verse eid="MAT 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Pharo tuke, Horazin! Pharo tuke, Vitsaida! Soske, o čudija so ule tumende te oven sine kerde ko Tir hem Sidon, ola angleder ka pokajnen pe sine hem ka uraven pe ko vreke hem ka čhiven pravo upro pumare šere. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ama me vakerava tumenge, e Tireske hem e Sidoneske ka ovel polokhe ko sudno dive nego tumenge. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />A tu Kapernaume, ka ove li vazdimo dži ko nebo? Na, tu ka hule dži ko than e mulengoro. Soske, o čudija so ule tumende te oven sine kerde ko Sodom, ka pokajnen pe sine hem o Sodom ka ačhol sine dži avdive da. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ama me vakerava tumenge, e Sodomeske ka ovel polokhe ko sudno dive nego tumenge.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aven ki mande hem odmorinen tumen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Togaš o Isus phengja: “Slavinava tut, Dade, Gospode e neboskoro hem e phuvijakoro, soske garagjan akava taro mudra hem taro učime, hem sikavgjan le okolenge soj tane sar tikne čhave. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Oja, Dade, soske adava manglan te kere.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Sa i mange dendo taro mo Dad. Nikoj na džanela e Čhave, osven o Dad, hem nikoj na džanela e Dade, osven o Čhavo hem okolenge so o Čhavo birinela te sikavel le.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Aven ki mande sarine so sijen umorna hem so isi tumen pharipe, hem me ka lokjarav tumen. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Len mo jarem ki tumende hem sikloven mandar, soske me sijum krotko hem ponizno ko srce, hem ka arakhen odmor tumare dušake. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Soske mo jarem tano lokho hem mo pharipe nane pharo.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus tano Gospodari e sabotakoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ko adava vreme o Isus ki sabota nakhla maškar o nive, a o učenikija leskere bokhalile hem počminge te phagen klasija giv hem te han.<verse eid="MAT 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Koga dikhle adava o Fariseja vakerge leske: “Dikh, te učenikija kerena adava so nane dozvolimo taro Zakoni ki sabota.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Na čitingjen li so o David kergja, koga sine bokhale ov hem o manuša so sine leja? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Ov khugja ko kher e Devleskoro, i ov hem okola so sine leja hale o maro so sine posvetimo, so nasminela sine nikoj te hal osven o sveštenikija. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ili na čitingjen li ko Zakoni deka o sveštenikija phagena o Zakoni adaleja so kerena buti ki sabota ko Hrami, a palem nane kriva. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />A me phenava tumenge deka akate tano adava soj pobaro taro Hrami. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Te džanen sine so značinena akala lafija: ‘Milost mangava a na samo žrtva’, nane sine te sudinen akalen so nane kriva. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Adaleske o Čhavo Manušeskoro tano Gospodari e sabotakoro.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela ki sabota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />I adathar o Isus gelo ki lengiri sinagoga. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Hem adathe sine jekh manuš so leskoro vas sine šuko hem našti sine te koristinel le. A o fariseja rodena sine šanca te šaj te tužinen i pučle le: “Dali dozvolimo te sasljarel pe ki sabota?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Ov phengja lenge: “Ako nekoj tumendar isi le bakhro hem pelo ki dupka ki sabota, nane li te astaren le hem te ikaven le? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />A kozom i povredno o manuš taro bakhro! Adaleske ki sabota i dozvolimo te kerel pe šukaripe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Togaš phengja e manušeske: “Pružin to vas!” Ov pružingja po vas hem leskoro vas saslilo, isto sar o dujto. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />A o fariseja iklile hem počminge te dogovorinen pe sar te mudaren e Isuse.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Birimo Sluga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Koga doznangja adava o Isus, cidingja pe adathar. A palo leste džana sine bari gužva hem ov sasljargja sa e nasvalen. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Hem opomeningja len te na vakeren javerenge baši leske. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Te šaj te phergjol adava soj phendo preku prorok Isaija:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Akje tano mo Sluga, so biringjum le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Mo manglo, so ki leste mi duša bahtali.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Ka čhivav mo Duho upro leste,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">hem ov ka sikavel i pravda e narodonge.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Nane te košel pe ili te vikinel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">nikoj nane te šunel o glaso leskoro ko ulice.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Ni o gazime trske nane te phagel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">hem nane te ačhavel i momoli so pohari thablola</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">sa dži kote na anela i pravda ki pobeda.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Ko leskoro anav o narodo ka nadinen pe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Isa 42:1-4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o Veelzevul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Togaš anglo Isus ange jekhe manuše so sine opsednimo demonencar. Ov sine korolo hem laloro, i o Isus sasljargja le, te šaj te dikhel hem te kerel lafi. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Hem sa o narodo čudisalilo hem vakergja: “Te nane akava o Čhavo e Davideskoro?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ama koga šunge adava o fariseja, vakerge: “Akava ikalela e demonen e Veelzevuleskere silaja, o gospodari e demonengoro.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />O Isus džangja lengere misle hem vakergja: “Sekova carstvo soj maškar peste delimo ka ovel uništimo, hem sekova gradi ili kher so maškar peste tano delimo, ka perel. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ako o Beng ikalela e Benge, ov tano delimo maškar peste. Sar togaš šaj ačhola leskoro carstvo? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ako me ikavava e demonen e Veelzevuleskere silaja, tumare učenikija kaskere silaja ikavena len? Adaleske ola ka oven tumare sudije. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ama, ako e Devleskere Duhoja ikagjum demonen, togaš e Devleskoro carstvo alo upra tumende.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Ili sar šaj nekoj te khuvel ko kher kote so bešela zoralo manuš hem te čorel le, osven ako angleder na phandla le? Togaš, koga ka phandel le, ka šaj te čorel sa taro kher.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Koj nane mancar, ov tano protiv mande, a koj na khedela mancar, ov rasturinela. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Adaleske phenava tumenge: e manušenge šaj te oven oprostime sa o grevija hem o hule so hulinena, ama nane te ovel lenge oprostimo i hula upro Sveti Duh. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Hem sekoj so ka vakerel lafi protiv o Čhavo Manušeskoro šaj te ovel leske oprostimo, ama sekoj so ka kerel lafi protiv o Sveti Duh nane te ovel leske oprostimo, ni ko akava sveto ni ko okova so avela.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Sadinen šukar kaš, i leskere plodija ka oven šukar, ili ako sadingjen lošno kaš, leskere plodija ka oven lošna, soske o kaš pendžarela pe taro leskoro plodi. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Tumen e sapeskere čhave, sar šaj tumen so sijen lošna te vakeren nešto šukar? Soske o muj vakerela adava soleja o srce tano pherdo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />O šukar manuš ikalela šukar bukja taro šukaripe so isi ki leste, a o lošno manuš ikalela lošna bukja taro lošnipe so isi ki leste. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Ama phenava tumenge deka sekoj ka odgovorinel ko sudno dive baši sekova jekh čučo lafi so vakergja. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Soske te lafencar ka ove ili opravdimo ili sudimo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O znako taro Jona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Togaš nesave učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o fariseja phenge leske: “Učitele, mangaja te dikha znako tutar.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “I lošno hem i neverno generacija rodela znako! Ama nisavo znako nane te del pe, osven o znako so ulo e prorokoja e Jonaja. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Soske sar o Jona so sine trin dive hem trin rakja ko vogi e bare mačheske, agjar o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel trin dive hem trin rakja ko najhor than tari phuv. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Ko sudno dive, o manuša taro gradi Ninevija ka ušten protiv akaja generacija hem ka sudinen la, soske ola pokajnge pe koga o Jona propovedingja, a akate tano nekoj pobaro taro Jona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Ko sudno dive, i kralica taro jug ka uštel protiv akaja generacija hem ka sudinel la, soske oj ali taro krajo e svetoskoro te šunel e Solomoneskiri mudrost, a akate tano nekoj pobaro taro Solomon.”<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koga o lošno duho iranela pe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Koga o lošno duho iklola taro manuš, ov nakhela taro šuke thana rodindor odmor. Koga na arakhela <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />vakerela: ‘Ka iranav man ko kher kotar so iklilum.’ I koga ka resel arakhela o kher čučo, čistimo hem namestimo. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Togaš džala hem lela peja efta javera duhija soj pološna lestar, hem ola khuvena hem živinena adathe. I ko krajo adava manuš ovela pološno nego angleder. Agjar ka ovel akale lošno generacijaja.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koj tani Isuseskiri familija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Dži kote o Isus kerela sine lafi e manušencar, i daj leskiri hem leskere phrajla tergjona sine avrik hem adžikerena sine te keren leja lafi. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />I nekoj phengja leske: “Ti daj hem te phrajla tergjona avrijal hem mangena te keren tuja lafi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Koj tani mi daj hem koj tane me phrajla?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Togaš sikavgja vasteja ko pe učenikija hem vakergja: “Akje akala tane mi daj hem me phrajla. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Soske koj kerela i vojla me Dadeskiri soj ko nebo, ov tano mo phral, mi phen hem mi daj.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo sejači</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Ko adava dive o Isus iklilo taro kher hem bešla uza ko ezero te sikavel. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Ov uklilo ko čamco hem adathe bešla adaleske so uza leste khedisalili bari gužva, a sa o manuša tergjona sine ko kopno. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />I but bukja vakerela sine ko parabole. Jekh taro adala parabole sine akaja:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Akje, iklilo jekh sejači te sejnel. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Dži kote sejnela sine o seme, nesavo seme pelo lestar ko drumo, i ale o čirikla hem sa hale o seme. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Javer pelo lestar ko than kote so sine hari phuv, a poviše bara, i odma počminge te iklon, soske na sine ki hor phuv. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Ama, koga iklilo o kham te tharel, ola thabile hem šukile, adaleske so na sine len korenja. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />A javer seme pelo maškar o kare, i koga barile o kare zagušinge len. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />A nesavo seme pelo ki šukar phuv, kote so dengja šukar plodija – šel puti, šovardeš puti ili trijanda puti poviše taro sejmo. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Kas isi kana, neka šunel.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soske o Isus vakerela ko parabole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />E Isuseskere učenikija ale ki leste hem pučle le: “Soske vakereja e manušenge ko parabole?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />A ov odgovoringja lenge: “Adaleske so tumenge dendo te džanen o tajne taro carstvo nebesno, ama okolenge nane dendo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kas isi, ka del pe leske poviše, hem ka ovel le but. A kas nane, hem adava da so isi le ka lel pe lestar. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Adaleske vakerava lenge ko parabole, soske jakhencar dikhena, a na dikhena, kanencar šunena, a na svatinena.<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Agjar upro lende pherdilo o proroštvo e Isaijaskoro:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 13:14" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Ka šunen, ama nikat nane te svatinen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">ka dikhen jakhencar, ama nikat nane te pendžaren.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Soske akale manušengoro vilo ulo baralo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">phareste šunena kanencar</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">hem phandle pumare jakha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">te na dikhen jakhencar</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">hem te na šunen kanencar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">a vileja te na svatinen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Adaleske našti te iranen pe ki mande</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">te sasljarav len.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Ama blagoslovime te jakha so dikhena hem te kana so šunena. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Čače vakerava tumenge: But prorokija hem pravednikija mangle te dikhen adava so tumen dikhena, ama na dikhle, hem te šunen adava so tumen šunena, ama na šunge.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus objasninela i parabola bašo sejači</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Šunen so značinela i parabola bašo sejači: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Koga nekoj ka šunel o lafi bašo carstvo nebesno hem na svatinela le, avela o Beng hem čorola adava soj sejmo ko leskoro srce. Adavaj o seme soj sejmo ko drumo. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />A o seme soj sejmo ko poviše bara a pohari phuv, tano okova so šungja o lafi hem odma primingja le so radost. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ama soske nane le koreno ki peste, na ačhola but. Koga avena o problemija ili o progoniba bašo lafi, ola odma perena tari vera. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />O seme so sejmo maškar o kare tano okova so šungja o lafi, ama o sekiracije akale životoskere hem o hovavno barvalipe zagušinela o lafi, i našti anela plodija. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ama o seme soj sejmo ki šukar phuv tano okova so šunela o lafi hem svatinela le. Ov tano okova so dela šukar plodija – šel puti, šovardeš puti ili trijanda puti poviše taro sejmo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo kakol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />O Isus vakergja lenge javer parabola: “O carstvo nebesno tano sar jekh manuš so sadingja šukar seme ki pi niva. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ama dži kote sarine sovena sine, alo leskoro dušmani hem ov da sadingja kakol maškar o giv hem gelo peske. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Koga o giv barilo hem angja plodija, togaš o kakol da iklilo.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />O sluge ale ko po gazda hem vakerge leske: ‘Gospodare, na sadingjan li šukar seme ki ti niva? E kotar alo akava kakol?’<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Ov phengja lenge: ‘Mo dušmani kergja adava.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">A o sluge pučle le: ‘Mangeja li te dža hem te ikala o kakol?’<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Ov odgovoringja lenge: ‘Na, adaleske so tumen ko ikalibe adava šaj te ikalen o giv da. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Mukhen o solduj te bajron dži ki žetva. Togaš ka phenav okolenge so khedena: Prvo kheden o kakol hem phanden le ki kupa te šaj te tharel pe, a poslem kheden o giv hem legaren le ki mi štala.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo sinapovo zrno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />O Isus vakergja lenge javer parabola: “O carstvo nebesno tano sar o sinapovo zrno, so manuš lela le hem sadingja le ki pi niva. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Ov tano najtikno taro sa o semija, ama koga bajrola, ovela najbaro taro sa o rastenija ki bavča i ovela kaš, agjar so o čirikla avena hem kerena gnezdija upro leskere granke.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo kvasaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />I phengja lenge javer parabola: “O carstvo nebesno tano sar o kvasaci, so jekh džuvli lela le hem mešingja le ko biš kile varo sa dži kote na ušlilo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Sa akava o Isus vakergja e manušenge ko parabole. Ništo na vakergja lenge bizi parabola. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Agjar pherdilo adava so sine phendo preku o proroko:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 13:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ka phravav mo muj ko parabole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">ka phenav o tajne so sine garavde panda taro keriba e svetoskoro.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Ps 78:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus objasninela i parabola bašo kakol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Togaš o Isus mukhla e manušen hem khugja ko jekh kher. Ale leskere učenikija ki leste hem phenge leske: “Vaker amenge so manglan te phene akale parabolaja bašo kakol ki niva.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />A ov odgovoringja: “Adava so sadingja o šukar seme tano o Čhavo Manušeskoro, <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />a i niva tani o sveto. O šukar seme tane o čhave taro carstvo nebesno, a o kakol tane o čhave e Bengeskere. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />A o dušmani so sadinela o kakol tano o Beng. I žetva tani o krajo e svetoskoro, a okola so khedena tane o angejla.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Sar so o kakol ikalela pe hem tharela pe ki jag, agjar ka ovel hem ko krajo e svetoskoro. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />O Čhavo Manušeskoro ka bičhavel pe angelen, hem ola ka ikalen len taro carstvo sarinen so čhivena javeren te grešinen hem so kerena lošno <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />hem ka frden len ki thari pečka, kote so ka ovel rojba hem krckjiba dandencar. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Togaš o pravednikija ka svetinen sar o kham ko carstvo pumare Dadeskoro. Kas isi kana neka šunel.”<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo garavdo barvalipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“O carstvo nebesno tano sar o barvalipe soj garavdo ki niva. Koga jekh manuš ka arakhel le, palem garavela le hem so radost džala, bikinela sa so isi le hem kinela adaja niva.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo biseri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Palem, o carstvo nebesno tano sar jekh trgovco so rodela šuže bisejra. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Koga arakhela nesavo najskupo biseri, džala hem bikinela sa so isi le hem kinela le.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola baši mreža</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Palem, o carstvo nebesno tano sar mreža so frdela pe ko ezero, so late astarela pe razna mačhe. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Koga phergjola, o ribajra ikalena la avrik. Poslem bešena hem khedena e šukar mačhen ko korpe, a e lošnon frdena. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Agjar ka ovel hem ko krajo e svetoskoro. O angejla ka aven hem ka odvinen e lošnon taro pravednikija <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />hem ka frden e lošnon ki thari pečka, kote so ka ovel rojba hem krckjiba dandencar.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />I o Isus pučlja len: Svatingjen li sa akala bukja?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Ola odgovoringe: “Oja.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />A ov phengja lenge: “Adaleske, sekova učiteli e Zakoneskoro, soj sikavdo taro carstvo nebesno – ov tano sar domakini e khereskoro, so ikalela andral pestar o nevo hem o purano barvalipe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus nane prifatimo ko Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Koga o Isus završingja akala parabole, gelo adathar. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />A koga resla ko po than kaj so barilo, počmingja te sikavel len ko lengere sinagoge, hem ola but čudisalile, hem pučle: “Kotar leske akaja mudrost hem akala čudna sile? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Nane li akava o čhavo e stolareskoro? Nane li leskiri daj i Marija, hem leskere phrajla o Jakov, o Josif, o Simon hem o Juda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Hem nane li sa akate leskere phenja amencar? Kotar leske sa akala bukja?”<verse eid="MAT 13:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ola na mangle te prifatinen le.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Ama o Isus phengja lenge: “E proroko ko sa o thana poštojnena le samo ko than kote so barilo, maškar leskoro gradi hem leskoro kher na poštojnena le.”<verse eid="MAT 13:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />I na kergja but čudija adathe soske na sine len vera.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">O meriba e Jovane Krstiteleskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ko adava vreme o Irod, o vladiteli e Galilejakoro šungja bašo Isus <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />hem phengja pe slugenge “Akavaj o Jovan Krstitel; uštilo taro mule hem adaleske šaj kerela asavke čudija.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Soske korkori o Irod angleder bičhalgja te astaren e Jovane hem te frden le ko zatvor. A adava kergja baši i Irodijada, i romni leskere phraleskiri e Filipeskiri, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />soske o Jovan phenela sine e Irodeske: “Nane tuke dozvolimo te le romnake te phraleskere romna.”<verse eid="MAT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />O Irod mangla te mudarel e Jovane, ama darandilo taro narodo, soske dikhena sine e Jovane sar proroko.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ama koga sine o rodenden e Irodeskoro, e Irodijadakiri čhaj khelgja anglo gostija. A e Irodeske adava sine but šukar. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Hem ov hala lake sovli deka ka del la sa so ka rodel.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />A oj sikavdi tari pi daj vakergja: “De man akate ko čaro o šero e Jovane Krstiteleskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />E Irodeske sine žal, ama baši i sovli so dengja la anglo gostija, naredingja te keren adava so rodingja, <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />hem naredingja te čhinen o šero e Jovane Krstiteleskoro ko zatvor. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />I sine ando leskoro šero ko čaro hem denge le e čhajake, a oj dengja le pe dajake. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />A o učenikija e Jovaneskere ale hem lele leskoro telo hem parunge le. A palo adava gele hem vakerge e Isuseske.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus parvarela poviše taro pandž ilade manuša</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Koga šungja adava o Isus, gelo adathar e čamcoja ko jekh čučo than. Ama o narodo šunge adava hem gele peški pala leste taro sa o gradija. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Koga o Isus iklilo taro čamco, dikhla bute manušen, alo leske but pharo baši lenge hem sasljargja e nasvalen so sine maškar lende.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />I koga sine kasno, ale o učenikija uza leste hem phenge leske: “Kasno i više, a ko akava than nane ništo. Mukh e manušen te džan ko gava te šaj kinena peske maro.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />A o Isus vakergja lenge: “Na trebela te džan. Den len tumen nešto hajbaske.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ola odgovoringe leske: “Akate isi amen samo pandž mare hem duj mačhe.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />A ov phengja: “Anen len mange akate.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />I naredingja e manušenge te bešen ki čar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:19">Togaš lela o pandž mare hem o duj mačhe dikhla upre ko nebo, blagodaringja hem phagla o mare. Palo adava dengja pe učenikonge, a o učenikija denge len e manušenge. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Sarinen hale hem čalile, a taro adava so ačhilo o učenikija khedinge dešuduj korpe hajbe. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />A adala so hale sine paše pandž ilade murša, bizo te gejnen pe o romna hem o čhave.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus phirela upro pani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Odma palo adava o Isus čhigja pe učenikon te uklen ko čamco hem angleder lestar te džan ki okoja strana taro ezero, dži kote ov bičhavela e manušen pe kherende. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Koga bičhalgja len, uklilo ki jekh planina korkori te molinel pe. I koga peli i rat, ov sine korkori adathe. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />A o čamco više sine dur taro kopno, hem počmingja te khuven le o talasija, soske prema lende phudela sine i bavlal.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />A maškar o trin dži ko šov o sati sabajle, o Isus alo ki lende phirindor upro pani. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Koga dikhle o učenikija sar phirela upro pani, but darandile hem počminge te vikinen tari dar: “Adavaj duho!”<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Ama o Isus odma phengja lenge: “Oven silna! Ma daran! Me sijum.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />A o Petar vakergja leske: “Gospode ako sijan tu, zapovedin mange te avav ki tute upro pani.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />I o Isus phengja leske: “Ava.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Togaš o Petar iklilo taro čamco hem phirindor upro pani gelo ko Isus.<verse eid="MAT 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ama koga dikhla i silno bavlal, darandilo hem počmingja te batinel ko pani i vikingja: “Gospode, spasin man!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />O Isus odma pružingja po vas hem astargja le, i phengja leske: “Tikne verakereja, soske sumningjan tut?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />I koga khuge ko čamco, i bavlal ačhili. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Togaš okola so sine ko čamco pele ko kočaka anglo Isus hem phenge leske: “Tu čače sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela e nasvalen ko Genisaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Koga o Isus nakhla pe učenikoncar ki okoja strana taro ezero, resle ki phuv Genisaretsko. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />A koga o manuša taro adava than pendžarge e Isuse, gele te vakeren sarinenge deka alo o Isus, i ola ange anglo leste sa e nasvalen. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Hem molinena le sine samo te mukhel len te pipinen pe ko krajo taro leskere šeja, hem sarinen so pipinena pe sine leskere šejende, sasljona sine.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">E Devleskere zapovedija hem o manušikane adetija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Togaš taro Erusalim ale nesave fariseja hem učitejla e Zakoneskere ko Isus hem pučle le: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Soske te učenikija phagena o adetija amare parapapongere? Ola na thovena pe vasta pred te han!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “A soske tumen da phagena e Devleskiri zapoved e adetencar? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Soske o Devel phengja: ‘Poštojn te dade hem te daja’ hem, ‘Koj ka del armanja pe dade hem pe daja, te ovel kaznimo meribaja.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Ama tumen vakerena ako nekoj phengja pe dadeske ili pe dajake: ‘Sa soleja šaj sine te pomožinav tut ko životo, više halum sovli deka ka dav le e Devleske’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />adava manuš na trebela te poštojnel pe dade ili pe daja. Agjar tumen čhinavena o lafi e Devleskoro bašo tumaro adeti.<verse eid="MAT 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Dujmujale! Šukar prorokujngja o prorok Isaija baši tumenge:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Akala manuša samo pe mujeja poštojnena man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">ama pe srceja dur tane mandar.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Džabe poštojnena man;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">sikavindor manušikane adetija.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela so mejlarela e manuše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />O Isus vikingja sa e narodo ki peste hem vakergja lenge: “Šunen hem svatinen: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Adava so khuvela andre ko muj e manušeske na kerela le melalo. Ama okova so iklola andral taro muj e manušeskoro, adava kerela le melalo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Togaš ale leskere učenikija ki leste hem phenge leske: “Džaneja li deka o fariseja navredisalile koga šunge akava?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />A ov vakergja lenge: “Sekova rastenije so na sadingja mo Dad soj ko nebo, ka ovel ikaldo korenoja. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Mukhen len; ola tane korole vodačija. Ako korolo phiragja e korole, o solduj ka peren ki dupka.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />O Petar phengja leske: “Objasnin amenge akaja parabola.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />I o Isus pučlja len: “Tumen panda li na svatingjen? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Na dikhena li deka sa so khuvela ko muj, džala ko vogi, hem palo adava iklola taro leskoro telo? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ama, adava so iklola taro muj e manušeskoro avela taro srce, hem adava kerela le melalo. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Soske taro srce, iklona o lošna misle, o mudariba, i preljuba, o bludstvo, o čoriba, o hovavne svedoštvija, o huliba. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Akava sa mejlarela e manuše, ama o hajbe bi thovde vastencar na mejlarela le.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I vera jekhe romnakiri so nane Evrejka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />I togaš o Isus iklilo taro adava than, hem gelo ko thana taro Tir hem Sidon.<verse eid="MAT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />I jekh romni Hananejka, taro adava than, ali ki leste hem vikingja: “Žalin man, Gospode, Čhavo e Davideskoro! Mi čhaj opsednimi demoneja hem but mučinela pe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ama o Isus na phengja lake ništo. A leskere učenikija ale ki leste hem molinge le: “Vaker lake te džal peske, soske vikinela hem avela pala amende.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Ov odgovoringja: “Me sijum bičhavdo samo ko našavde bakhre e Izraeleskere.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />I romni ali hem peli ko kočaka angli leste, hem phengja leske: “Gospode, pomožin man.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Ov odgovoringja: “Nane šukar te le pe taro čhave o maro hem te frdel pe e džukelenge.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />A oj phengja leske: “Oja, Gospode, adaleske so o džukela da hana o troške telo astali so perena taro lengere gospodajra.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Togaš o Isus phengja lake: “Manušnije, tute isi bari vera! Neka ovel sar so mangeja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:28">I lakiri čhaj ko adava momenti saslili.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela bute manušen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />O Isus gelo adathar ko Galilejsko ezero. Togaš uklilo ki jekh planina hem adathe bešla te sikavel.<verse eid="MAT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />But manuša ale ki leste hem ange pumencar: sakaten, korolen, bangen, laloren hem panda buten. I sarinen sigjarena sine te čhiven len anglo leskere pre, hem ov sasljargja len.<verse eid="MAT 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />A o manuša čudisalile koga dikhle sar o lalore kerena lafi, a o bange sasljarde, o sakatija phirena hem o korole dikhena. I ola slavinge e Izraeleskere Devle.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus parvarela poviše taro štar ilade manuša</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />O Isus vikingja pe učenikon uza peste hem phengja lenge: “Pharo mange akale manušenge. Trin dive tane mancar a nane len so te han. Na mangava te mukhav len bokhale, te na peren ko drumo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />A leskere učenikija pučle le: “Kaj šaj arakhaja ko akava čučo than dovolno maro bašo sa akala manuša te čajloven?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />O Isus pučlja len: “Kozom mare isi tumen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Ola odgovoringe: “Efta mare hem nekozom tikne mačhe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Togaš o Isus vakergja e manušenge te bešen tele ki phuv. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Lela o efta mare, hem o mačhe, blagodaringja lenge, phagla len hem dengja pe učenikonge, a ola delinge len e manušenge. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Sarinen hale hem čalile. A taro adava so ačhilo o učenikija khedinge efta pherde bare korpe. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Adala so hale sine štar ilade murša, bizo te gejnen pe o romna hem o čhave.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Palo adava o Isus bičhalgja len te džan peske, ov khugja ko čamco hem gelo ko thana taro Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">O fariseja rodena znako taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Togaš ale ko o Isus o fariseja hem o sadukeja hem iskušinge le adaleja so rodinge lestar znako taro nebo.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />A ov odgovoringja lenge: “Koga perel o kham, vakerena: ‘Ka ovel šužo vreme, soske o nebo tano lolo.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />A sabajle vakerena: ‘Avdive nane te ovel šužo o vreme, soske o nebo tano lolo hem oblačno.’ O izgled e neboskoro džanena te pendžaren, a na džanena te pendžaren o znakija e divengere ko save živinena. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />I lošno hem i neverno generacija rodela znako, ama nisavo znako nane te del pe, osven o znako so ulo e prorokoja e Jonaja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">I palo adava o Isus mukhla len hem gelo peske.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O kvasaci e farisejengoro hem e sadukejengoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />O učenikija nakhle tari javer strana taro ezero, ama bisterge te len peja o maro. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />I o Isus phengja lenge: “Pazinen! Arakhen tumen taro kvasaci e farisejengoro hem e sadukejengoro.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />A ola kerena sine lafi maškar peste: “Akava phengja amenge soske na lelem amencar maro.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />O Isus džangja so kerena lafi hem pučlja len: “Tikne verakere, soske kerena lafi maškar tumende deka nane tumen maro? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Panda li na svatinena? Na setinena tumen li bašo pandž mare e pandže ilade manušenge hem kozom bare korpe khedingjen? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ili o efta mare e štare ilade manušenge hem kozom bare korpe khedingjen? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Sar na svatinena deka na vakergjum tumenge bašo maro? Ama arakhen tumen taro kvasaci e farisejengoro hem e sadukejengoro.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Togaš svatinge deka na vakergja lenge te arakhen pe taro kvasaci e mareskoro, nego taro učibe e farisejengoro hem e sadukejengoro.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar phenela deka o Isus tano o Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Koga o Isus alo ko thana taro e Filipeskiri Cezarija, pučlja pe učenikon: “So phenena o manuša, koj tano o Čhavo Manušeskoro?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Ola odgovoringe leske: “Nekoj phenela o Jovan Krstitel, a javera phenena deka o prorok Ilija, a nesave javera phenena deka o Eremija ili jekh taro javera prorokija.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Togaš o Isus pučlja len: “A tumen? So phenena, koj sijum me?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />O Simon Petar odgovoringja leske: “Tu sijan o Hristos, o Čhavo e dživde Devleskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />A o Isus phengja leske: “Blagoslovimo sijan Simone, čhavo e Jonaskoro, soske akava na sine tuke phendo taro manuš, nego taro mo Dad soj ko nebo. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />A me phenava tuke deka tu sijan o Petar, hem ki akaja karpa ka gradinav mi crkva, hem o udara taro than e mulengoro našti te pobedinen la. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Hem ka dav tut o klučija taro carstvo nebesno, i sa so ka phande ki phuv, ka ovel phandlo ko nebo, hem sa so ka phrave ki phuv ka ovel phravdo ko nebo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Togaš zapovedingja pe učenikonge ma te vakeren nikaske deka ov tano o Hristos.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Od togaš o Isus počmingja te vakerel pe učenikonge deka mora te džal ko Erusalim hem but te cidel taro starešine, taro prvosveštenikija hem taro učitejla e Zakoneskere, hem deka mora te ovel mudardo hem o trito dive ka uštel taro mule.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />I o Petar cidingja le ki jekh strana, hem zaptingja le vakerindor: “Nikat Gospode! Akava nikat nane te ovel tuke!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />A o Isus irangja pe ki leste hem phengja: “Naš mandar, Benga! Tergjoveja mange ko drumo, soske na mislineja adava soj Devleskoro, nego manušeskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sar te ove e Isuseskoro učeniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Togaš o Isus phengja pe učenikonge: “Koj mangela te ovel mo učeniko, mora te otkažinel pe pestar hem mora te lel po krsto hem mora te phirel pala mande. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Soske koj mangela te spasinel po životo, ka našavel le, a koj ka našavel po životo baši mange ka arakhel le. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />So džabe celo sveto te le, ako ti duša našagjan? Ili soleja o manuš šaj zameninela pi duša? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Soske o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka avel ki slava pe Dadeskiri pe angelencar hem togaš ka nagradinel sarinen spored adava so kergja.<verse eid="MAT 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Čače vakerava tumenge, isi nesave akate maškar tumende so nane te meren, dži kote na dikhena o Čhavo Manušeskoro sar avela ko po carstvo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela pi slava pe trine učenikonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />A palo šov dive o Isus lela peja e Petare e Jakove hem leskere phrale e Jovane hem gele ki uči gora, kote so ola sine korkori. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Adathe angli lende e Isuseskoro izgled promenisalilo. Leskoro muj svetinela sine sar o kham, a o šeja leskere ule parne sar i svetlina. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Togaš adathe pojavisalile angli lende o Mojsej hem o Ilija, so kerena sine lafi e Isuseja.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />A o Petar phengja e Isuseske: “Gospode, šukar amenge te ova akate. Te mangeja, ka kera trin šatojra – jekh tuke, jekh e Mojsijaske, hem jekh e Ilijaske.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Dži kote o Petar kerela sine lafi, svetlinaja oblako učhargja len hem šundilo glaso taro oblako: “Akava tano mo manglo Čhavo, so leste tani mi vojla. Le šunen!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Koga šunge adava o učenikija, but darandile hem pele mujeja dži ki phuv.<verse eid="MAT 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Ama o Isus alo uza lende, pipingja len, hem phengja lenge: “Ušten hem ma daran!”<verse eid="MAT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Togaš vazdinge pumare šere hem na dikhle nikas osven e Isuse.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Koga hulena sine tari gora, o Isus zapovedingja lenge: “Ma vakeren nikaske so dikhlen, sa dži kote o Čhavo Manušeskoro na uštela taro mule.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />A o učenikija pučle le: “Soske togaš o učitejla e Zakoneskere vakerena deka prvo mora te avel o Ilija?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Čače o Ilija ka avel prvo hem ka sredinel sa. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ama vakerava tumenge: o Ilija više alo, hem na pendžarge le, nego kerge leske sa so mangle. Agjar hem o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka cidel taro lengere vasta.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Togaš o učenikija svatinge deka ov kerela lafi bašo Jovan Krstitel.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ikalela e čhavestar o lošno duho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Koga ale ko narodo, alo jekh manuš ko Isus hem pelo ko kočaka angli leste. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />Hem phengja: “Gospode, žalin me čhave. Le isi le napadija hem but cidela. Stalno perela ki jag ili ko pani. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Angjum le ko te učenikija, ama ola našti sine te sasljaren le.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “O, bez verno hem rumimi generacijo, dži koga ka ovav tumencar? Dži koga ka trpinav tumen? Anen e čhave ki mande!”<verse eid="MAT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />A o Isus naredingja e demoneske hem ov iklilo e čhavestar, hem ko adava momenti o čhavo saslilo.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Togaš o učenikija ale ko Isus korkori hem pučle le: “Soske amen našti sine te ikala le?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Ov odgovoringja lenge: “Adaleske so isi tumen doborom tikni vera. Čače vakerava tumenge: ako isi tumen vera sar o sinapovo zrno, šaj te phenen akale planinake: ‘Pomestin tut akatar okorik’, hem oj ka pomestingjovel. Hem nane ništo so našti te keren. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />[Asavko duho ništoja našti te ikalel pe, samo molitvaja hem posteja.]”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus dujto puti vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Koga khedisalile ki Galileja, o Isus phengja pe učenikonge: “O Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel predajmo ko vasta e manušenge. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Ka mudaren le hem ko trito dive ka uštel taro mule.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">A o učenikija but razočaringe pe.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Hrameskoro danok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Koga o Isus hem leskere učenikija resle ko Kapernaum, ale ko Petar nesave manuša so khedena sine danok e hrameskoro so sine duj drahme, i pučle le: “Tumaro učiteli platinela li danok e Hrameske?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />O Petar odgovoringja: “Oja, platinela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Koga o Petar khugja ko kher, o Isus angleder leste phengja hem pučlja le: “So mislineja, Simone, kastar o cajra e phuvijakere khedena carina hem danok? Taro pe čhave ili taro javera?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />O Petar odgovoringja: “Taro javera.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Togaš o Isus phengja: “Znači o čhave na trebela te platinen. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Ama, te na uvredžina len, dža ko ezero hem frde i jadica. O prvo mačho so ka astare, phrav o muj leskoro hem ka arakhe pare taro štar drahme. Le hem platin lenge baši mange hem tuke o danok.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Koj tano najbaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ko adava vreme ale o učenikija ko Isus hem pučle le: “Togaš koj tano najbaro ko carstvo nebesno?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />O Isus vikingja ki peste jekhe tikne čhave hem čhigja le maškar lende <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />hem phengja: “Čače vakerava tumenge, ako na promeningjen tumen hem na ulen sar tikne čhave, nikat nane te khuven ko carstvo nebesno. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Adaleske, koj ponizinela pe hem ovela sar akava tikno čhavo, ov tano najbaro ko carstvo nebesno. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Hem koj ka priminel jekhe asavke tikne čhave ko mo anav, man priminela.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela sar te na pera ko grevo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Ako nekoj čhivela jekhe taro akala tikne čhave so verujnena ki mande te perel ko grevo, pošukar leske te phandel pe baro bar ki men hem te ovel tasavdo ko hor pani e moreskoro.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Pharo e manušenge taro sveto, adaleske so čhivena javere te perel ko grevo. Asavke bukja mora te aven, ama but i pharo adale manušeske kastar so avela adava! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Ako to vas ili to pro čhivela tut ko grevo, čhin le hem frde le tutar. Pošukar i te khuve ko večno životo sakati ili bango nego te oven tut o solduj vasta ili o solduj pre, a te ove frdimo ki večno jag. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ako ti jakh čhivela tut ko grevo, ikav la hem frde la tutar. Pošukar i te khuve ko večno životo jekhe jakhaja, nego te oven tut o solduj jakha, a te ove frdimo ko jagalo pekol.”<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo našavdo bakhro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Pazinen te na dikhen po tele jekhe taro akala tikne. Soske vakerava tumenge deka lengere angejla ko nebo sekat tergjona anglo mo Dad soj ko nebo. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />[Soske o Čhavo Manušeskoro alo te rodel hem te spasinel e našavden.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />So mislinena? Ako jekh manuš isi le šel bakhre, i jekh lendar našavdilo, nane li te mukhel e enjavardešu enjen ki planina hem te džal te rodel adale bakhre so našavdilo? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Hem te arakhla le, čače vakerava tumenge, poviše ka radujnel pe leske, nego okole enjavardešu enjenge so na našavdile. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Agjar ni tumaro Dad soj ko nebo, na mangela nijekh taro akala tikne te našavgjoven.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sar te rešinel pe o grevo e vernikoncar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Ako to phral grešingja tuke, dža korkori hem vaker leske so grešingja tuke. Te šungja tut, dobingjan te phrale. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ama ako na šungja tut, le tuja panda jekhe ili dujen, te šaj ‘duje ili trine svedokoncar te dokažinel pe sekoja buti.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />I ako na šungja len da, vaker e crkvake. I te na mangla te šunel e crkva da, dikh le sar okole so na džanela e Devle ili sar danočniko.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Čače vakerava tumenge, sa so ka phanden ki phuv, ka ovel phandlo ko nebo, hem sa so ka phraven ki phuv, ka ovel phravdo ko nebo.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Palem čače vakerava tumenge, ako duj džene tumendar soglasinge pe ki phuv, soj te roden, ka del len adava mo Dad soj ko nebo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Soske, kote soj duj ili trin džene khedime ko mo anav, me da sijum adathe lencar.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo nemilostlivo sluga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Togaš o Petar alo ko Isus hem pučlja le: “Gospode, kozom puti te oprostinav me phraleske so grešinela mange? Efta puti?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Vakerava tuke, na efta puti, nego eftavardeš puti po efta.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Adaleske vakerava akava: o carstvo nebesno tano sar caro so mangela sine pe slugencar te račistinel pe, adaleske so dužinena sine leske. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Koga počmingja te gejnel, ange angli leste jekhe so dužinela leske sine deš ilade kese zlato. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Adaleske so na sine le te iranel leske, o caro naredingja adale sluga, leskere romna, e čhaven hem sa so isi le te bikinen te šaj agjar te iranel leske o dugo.<verse eid="MAT 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Togaš o sluga pelo ko kočaka anglo leste hem molingja le vakerindor: ‘Adžiker man hem me ka iranav tuke sa.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />E caroske pelo žal, oprostingja leske o dugo hem mukhla le te džal peske.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ama ov koga iklilo, arakhla jekhe amale, javere sluga, so dužinela leske sine šel srebrenikija. Astargja le hem počmingja te tasavel le, rodindor: ‘Iran mange mo dugo!’<verse eid="MAT 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Togaš leskoro amal pelo ko kočaka anglo leste hem molingja le vakerindor: ‘Adžiker man hem me ka iranav tuke sa.’<verse eid="MAT 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Ama ov na mangla te adžikerel, nego gelo hem frdingja pe amale ko zatvor dži kote na iranela leske o dugo.<verse eid="MAT 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Koga leskere amala, o javera sluge, dikhle so ulo, sine lenge but pharo i gele hem vakerge sa e caroske so ulo.<verse eid="MAT 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Togaš o caro vikingja e sluga kaske so oprostingja o dugo hem phengja leske: ‘Lošno slugo! Oprostingjum tuke sa o dugo, soske molingjan man. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Na trebingja li te žaline tu da te amale, sar me so žalingjum tut?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />I o caro holangja hem dengja le ko čuvajra e zatvoreskere te mučinen le sa dži kote na iranela leske sa o dugo.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Agjar mo Dad soj ko nebo ka kerel tumenge, ako na oprostingjen tumare phraleske taro celo srce.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Bašo brako hem o razvod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Koga o Isus završingja akale lafencar, gelo tari Galileja ko thana ki Judeja, tari javer strana tari reka Jordan. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />A pala leste džana sine but manuša hem ov adathe sasljargja e nasvalen.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />I ale ki leste nesave fariseja te iskušinen le, i pučle le: “Dozvolimo li o rom te mukhel pe romna bašo bilo so?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Ov odgovoringja lenge: “Na čitingjen li deka ko početok o Stvoriteli ‘kergja len murš hem džuvli’? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Hem phengja: ‘Adaleske o manuš ka mukhel pe dade hem pe daja, hem ka ovel jekh pe romnaja, hem ola o duj ka oven jekh telo.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Agjar ola nane više duj, nego jekh telo. Adaleske, o Devel so phandla, o manuš ma te odvinel.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />A ola pučle le: “Soske togaš o Mojsej naredingja e manušeske te del pe romnake razvodno lil hem te mukhel la?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “O Mojsej dozvolingja tumenge te mukhen tumare romnen adaleske so sijen šerale, ama ko početok na sine agjar. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Ama vakerava tumenge deka sekoj so mukhela pe romna, osven ako izneveringja le, hem ka lel javera romnake, ov kerela preljuba.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Togaš leskere učenikija phenge: “Ako agjar i maškar o rom hem i romni, pošukar i te na len pe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “Našti sarine te prifatinen akava lafi, nego samo okola kaske i dendo. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Adaleske isi manuša soj bijame manaja hem nesposobna. A isi hem nesave so o manuša kerge len te oven nesposobna. A isi nesave so korkori odlučinge te na ženinen pe bašo nebesno carstvo. Koj so šaj prifatinela akava, neka prifatinel le.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus blagoslovinela e tikne čhaven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Togaš o manuša ange pe tikne čhaven anglo Isus te čhivel pe vasta upro lende hem te molinel pe lenge. Ama o učenikija zaptinge len.<verse eid="MAT 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />A o Isus phengja lenge: “Mukhen e tikne čhaven te aven ki mande hem ma zaptinen len, soske asavkjenge pripadinela o nebesno carstvo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ov čhigja pe vasta upro lende hem palo adava gelo adathar.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o barvalo manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Togaš alo jekh manuš ko Isus hem pučlja le: “Učitele, savi šukar buti trebela te kerav te šaj te dobinav o večno životo?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “Soske pučeja man bašo adava soj šukar? Isi samo jekh soj šukar - o Devel. Ako mangeja te khuve ko večno životo, iker o zapovedija.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Ov pučlja: “Save?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Akala: ‘ma mudar, ma ker preljuba, ma čor, ma svedočin hovajbe, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />poštojn te dade hem te daja’ hem ‘mang te pašutne sar korkori tut.’”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />A o terno manuš phengja leske: “Sa akava pazingjum le. So trebela panda te kerav?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Te mangeja te ove sovršeno, dža, bikin sa so isi tut hem delin e čorolenge, i ka ovel tut barvalipe upre ko nebo. Togaš ava hem phir pala mande.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Koga šungja akava o terno manuš, razočaringja pe hem gelo peske, adaleske so na mangla te bikinel po baro barvalipe.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Togaš o Isus vakergja pe učenikonge: “Čače phenava tumenge, pharo i adaleske soj barvalo te khuvel ko nebesno carstvo. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />I palem phenava tumenge, polokhe ka ovel e kamilake te nakhel maškar o kan e suvijakoro, nego e barvaleske te khuvel ko carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Koga o učenikija šunge akava, sine but čudime hem pučle: “Togaš, koj šaj te ovel spasimo?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />O Isus dikhla len šukar hem phengja: “Akavaj nešto so o manuša našti te keren, ama o Devel šaj kerela sa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Togaš o Petar odgovoringja leske: “Akje, amen mukhlem sa hem alem pala tute. So ka dobina adalestar?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />A o Isus phengja: “Čače phenava tumenge, ko nevo sveto, koga o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka bešel ko po slavno troni, hem tumen da so avena pala mande ka bešen ko dešuduj tronija hem ka sudinen e Izraeleskere dešuduje plemenge. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Hem sekoj jekh so mukhela po kher, ili pe phralen, ili pe phejnen, ili pe dade, ili pe daja, ili pe romna, ili pe čhaven, ili pe nive, baši mange, ka dobinel šel puti poviše hem ka nasledinel o večno životo. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Ama but džene soj prva ka oven posledna, a but džene soj posledna ka oven prva.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo rabotnikija ko drakha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Soske o carstvo nebesno tano sar domakini so rano sabajleja iklilo te rodel rabotnikija baši pi niva e drakhencar. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Ov dogovoringja pe te platinel lenge po jekh dinari ko dive so sine dnevnica bašo jekh dive i bičhalgja len ki pi niva.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Koga sine enja o sati sabajleja ov iklilo hem dikhla javeren sar tergjona ko pazari hem na kerena ništo. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />I phengja lenge: ‘Džan tumen da hem keren buti ki mi niva e drakhencar, a me ka platinav tumenge pošteno.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Hem ola gele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">A ov palem iklilo ko dešuduj o sati hem ko trin o sati paloručko, hem agjar kergja isto. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Ko pandž o sati paloručko palem iklilo hem arakhla javeren sar tergjona hem pučlja len: ‘Soske tergjovena akate celo dive hem na kerena ništo?’<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Ola odgovoringe leske: ‘Soske nikoj na dengja amen buti.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">A ov phengja lenge: ‘Džan hem tumen da ki mi niva.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Ko krajo e diveskoro, o gazda e drakhengoro phengja pe manušeske so sine upreder o rabotnikija: ‘Vikin e rabotnikon hem de len lengiri plata, počmindor taro okola so ale posledna, dži ko okola so ale prva.’<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Agjar ale o rabotnikija so kerge buti taro pandž o sati paloručko hem sekoj dobingja po jekh dinari. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Koga ale okola so počminge prvo te keren buti, adžikerena sine te len poviše. Ama sekoj lendar dobingja po jekh dinari. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Koga lele o pare, počminge te buninen pe protiv o gazda <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />vakerindor: ‘Akala so vikingjan len posledna kerge buti samo jekh sati, a tu platingjan len isto sar amen so platingjan. A amen celo dive kergjem phari buti hem thabilem ko kham.’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Ama o gazda odgovoringja jekheske lendar: ‘Amala, na sijum nepošteno prema tute. Na dogovoringjem amen li te kere buti jekhe dinareske? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Le ti plata hem dža, a me akaleske soj posledno mangava te dav doborom kozom so tuke dengjum. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Nane man li pravo me parencar te kerav so mangava? Ili tu sijan ljubomorno so sijum šukar prema lende?’<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Agjar okola soj posledna ka oven prva, a okola soj prva ka oven posledna.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus trito puti vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Dži kote džana sine ko Erusalim, drumaldan o Isus cidingja ki strana e dešudujen hem phengja lenge: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Akje džaja upre ko Erusalim hem adathe o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel predajmo ko prvosveštenikija hem ko učitejla e Zakoneskere, hem ola ka osudinen le ko meribe <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />hem ka predajnen le e manušenge so nane Evreja te šaj te asan leske, te kamšikujnen le hem te čhiven le ko krsto. Ama ko trito dive ka uštel taro mule.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O pučibe e Jakoveskere hem e Jovaneskere dajakoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Togaš i daj e Zavedejeskere čhavengiri, ali ko Isus pe čhavencar hem peli ko kočaka angli leste te rodel lestar nešto.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />I o Isus pučlja la: “So mangeja?” Oj vakergja: “De man lafi deka ko to carstvo, me duj čhave ka bešen jekh tari ti desno strana, a jekh tari ti levo strana.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />A o Isus phengja lenge: “Na džanena so rodena. Šaj li te pijen tari čaša kolatar me ka pijav?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Ola odgovoringe: “Šaj.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />I ov phengja lenge: “Čače ka pijen tari mi čaša, ama nane mlo te vakerav koj ka bešel tari mi desno hem tari mi levo strana. Adala thana ka del pe okolenge kaske mo Dad spremingja len.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Koga šunge adava o javera deš učenikija, holange e duje phralenge.<verse eid="MAT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Togaš o Isus vikingja len ki peste hem phengja: “Džanena deka o vladitejla okolengere so na pendžarena e Devle vladinena upro lende hem lengere da bare manuša mangena te keren adava silaja. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ama akava ma te ovel maškar tumende, a koj mangela te ovel baro maškar tumende, neka ovel tumenge sluga, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />hem koj mangela te ovel prvo maškar tumende, neka ovel tumenge robo, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />sar so o Čhavo Manušeskoro na alo te služinen leske, nego ov te služinel hem te del po životo sar otkup butenge.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela duje korole manušen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Dži kote o Isus hem o učenikija leskere iklona sine taro Erihon, pala leste džana sine bari gužva.<verse eid="MAT 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />I akje, duj korole manuša bešena sine uza ko drumo, i koga šunge deka nakhela o Isus vikinge: “Gospode, Čhavo e Davideskoro, ov milostlivo prema amende!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />But džene zaptinge len hem phenge lenge te na vikinen, ama ola poviše vikinge: “Gospode, Čhavo e Davideskoro, ov milostlivo prema amende!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />O Isus ačhilo, vikingja len hem pučlja: “So mangena te kerav tumenge?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Ola odgovoringe: “Gospode, mangaja te dikha.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />E Isuseske pelo žal baši lenge hem čhigja pe vasta upro lengere jakha, i ola odma dikhle hem gele pala leste.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus khuvela ko Erusalim sar caro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Koga o Isus hem leskere učenikija ale paše uza ko Erusalim, hem resle ki Vitfagija ki Maslinovo Gora, o Isus bičhalgja pe duje učenikon, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />vakerindor: “Džan ko akava gav soj angli tumende, hem odma ka arakhen jekh phandli herni so uza late tano lakoro čhavo. Phraven hem anen len ki mande. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />I te vakergja tumenge nekoj nešto, phenen: ‘E Gospodareske trebela’ hem adava manuš odma ka mukhel len.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Akava ulo te phergjol adava so sine phendo preku o proroko:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Vaker e manušenge taro Erusalim:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‘Akje to Caro avela ki tute,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">ponizno hem bešela upro her,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">upro terno her, e hernakoro čhavo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />O učenikija gele hem kerge agjar sar so phengja lenge o Isus. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Ange e herna hem e terne here, i čhige pe šeja upro terno her, te šaj te bešel o Isus. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />But džene bujlarge pe šeja ko drumo, dži kote javera manuša čhinena sine granke taro kašta hem bujlarena len ko drumo.<verse eid="MAT 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />O manuša so džana sine angli leste hem pali leste vikinena sine:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Osana e Davideskere Čhaveske!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">‘Blagoslovimo okova so avela ko anav e Gospodareskoro!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Osana ko učipe!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Koga o Isus khugja ko Erusalim, celo gradi bunisalilo hem pučle: “Koj tano akava?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />A o narodo odgovoringja: “Akavaj o Isus, o proroko taro Nazaret tari Galileja.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus na mukhela te bikinel pe ko Hrami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />O Isus khugja ko dvoro taro Hrami hem brkingja sa adalen so kinena hem bikinena sine. Irangja o astajla adalengere so meninena pare hem o tezge so bikinena sine gulubija.<verse eid="MAT 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Hem phengja lenge: “Pišimo i: ‘Mo kher ka vikinel pe kher baši molitva’, a tumen kerge le than ‘kote so khedena pe o čora.’”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />I ale o korole hem o bange ko Isus ko Hrami, hem ov sasljargja len.<verse eid="MAT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ama o prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere koga dikhle o čudija so kerela le sine o Isus hem o čhave ko dvoro taro Hrami sar vikinena: “Osana e Davideskere Čhaveske,” ola holange. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Hem pučle: “Šuneja li so o čhave vakerena?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Oja, šunava. Tumen nikat li na čitingjen:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">‘Taro e čhavengoro muj hem e bebengoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">o Gospodari ka spreminel po faliba’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Ps 8:2</ref>.</char></note>?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />I ov mukhla len hem gelo peske taro adava gradi ki Vitanija, kote so nakhagja i rat adathe.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus prokletinela i smokva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Rano sabajleja dži kote o Isus iranela pe sine ko gradi bokhalilo. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Koga dikhla jekh smokva uza ko drumo, gelo uza late, ama ki late na arakhla ništo osven listija.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:19">I togaš ov phengja: “Nikat više te na de plodija!” I odma o kaš šukilo.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Koga dikhle adava o učenikija, čudisalile hem pučle: “Sar šaj sine o kaš odma te šukjol?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “Čače, vakerava tumenge, ako isi tumen vera hem na sumningjen tumen, na samo so šaj te keren adava so ulo e smokvaja, nego hem šaj te vakeren akale planinake: ‘Ušti hem frde tut ko more’, hem ka ovel agjar. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Ako verujnena, ka dobinen sa so ka roden ki molitva.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskiri vlast</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />O Isus khugja ko dvoro taro Hrami hem dži kote sikavela sine, ale ki leste o prvosveštenikija hem o starešine e manušengere hem pučle le: “Kotar tuke akava avtoriteti te kere akala bukja? Koj dengja tut pravo te kere akava?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Ka pučav tumen me da nešto hem odgovorinen mange. I me da ka vakerav tumenge kotar mange pravo te kerav sa akava. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Kotar e Jovaneske o avtoriteti te krstinel – taro Devel ili taro manuš?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">A ola kerena sine lafi maškar peste: “Ako vakergjem: ‘Taro Devel tano’, ka vakerel: ‘Soske na verujngjen le’? <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Ako vakergjem: ‘Taro manuš’ daraja taro manuša, soske sarine dikhena e Jovane sar proroko.”<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />I ola odgovoringe e Isuseske: “Na džanaja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">A o Isus phengja lenge: “Me da na phenava tumenge kotar mange pravo te kerav sa akava.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo duj čhave</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Togaš o Isus pučlja: “So mislinena: Sine jekh manuš so sine le duj čhave. Ov gelo ko prvo čhavo hem phengja leske: ‘Mo čhavo, dža hem ker buti avdive ko drakha.’<verse eid="MAT 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />A ov odgovoringja: ‘Na džava.’ Ama poslem pelo pišmani hem gelo.<verse eid="MAT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Togaš o dad gelo ko dujto čhavo hem phengja leske isto. Ov odgovoringja leske: ‘Ka džav, gospodare’ ama ov na gelo.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Koj taro akala duj kergja e dadeskiri vojla?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Ola odgovoringe: “O prvo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">O Isus phengja lenge: “Čače vakerava tumenge, o danočnikija hem o bludnikija angli tumende ka oven ko carstvo e Devleskoro. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Soske o Jovan Krstitel alo ki tumende te sikavel o drumo baši pravda, a tumen na verujngjen le, nego o danočnikija hem o bludnikija verujnge le. Hem tumen akava dikhlen, ama na pokajngjen tumen hem na verujngjen le.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo lošna lozajra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />“Šunen panda jekh parabola: Sine jekh domakini so sadingja drakha. Ov čhigja ograda, randla dupka hem kergja than kote so šaj kerela pe i mol, hem kergja kula te šaj pazinena i drakh. Togaš dengja le ki kirija nesave lozarenge hem gelo peske. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />I koga alo vreme te kheden o drakha, ov bičhalgja pe slugjen ko lozajra te kheden jekh delo taro plodi. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Ama o lozajra astarge leskere slugjen, jekhe marge, javere mudarge, a upro javer frdinge bara dži kote na mulo.<verse eid="MAT 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Ov palem bičhalgja javere slugjen, poviše taro prvo puti, hem o lozajra isto kerge lenge da sar e prvonencar.<verse eid="MAT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Ko krajo bičhalgja pe čhave, vakerindor: ‘Ka poštojnen me čhave.’<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Ama o lozajra koga dikhle leskere čhave, vakerge maškar peste: ‘Akavaj o nasledniko. Ajde te mudara le hem te la leskoro nasledstvo.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Astarge, mudarge le hem frdinge le avrik taro adava than.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Adaleske koga ka avel o gazda e drakhengoro, so ka kerel e lozarenge?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Ola odgovoringe leske: “Ka mudarel adalen bizo dar, hem ka del ki kirija o drakha javere manušenge, so ka den le o plodija koga ka avel o vreme baši žetva.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />O Isus phengja lenge: “Nikat li na čitingjen akava ko Sveto Lil:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:42" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">‘O bar so sine frdimo taro zidajra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">adava bar ulo temeli e khereskoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Adava kergja o Gospodari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">hem buti šužo anglo amare jakha’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Ps 118:22-23</ref>.</char></note>?<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Adaleske vakerava tumenge: ka lel pe tumendar o carstvo e Devleskoro hem ka del pe e manušenge so ka den le leskere plodija. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Sekoj so ka perel ko akava bar ka ovel phago ko kotora, a upra kaste ka perel adava bar ka ovel mečimo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Koga o prvosveštenikija hem o fariseja šunge akala parabole taro Isus, džange deka vakerela len baši lenge. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />I rodena sine sar te astaren le, ama darana sine taro narodo, soske ola dikhena le sine sar proroko e Isuse.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo bijav</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />O Isus palem počmingja te vakerel ko parabole: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“O carstvo nebesno tano sar caro so kergja bijav pe čhaveske. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Ov bičhalgja pe slugjen, te vikinen okolen so sine pokanime ko bijav, ama ola na mangle te aven.<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Palo adava bičhalgja javeren slugjen hem phengja: ‘Vakeren okolenge soj pokanime deka o hajbe i kerdo. Pekljem najšužo guruvano mas. Sa i kerdo, “Aven ko bijav.”’<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Ama ola na šunge nego gele – jekh ki pi niva, a javer ki pi buti. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />A javera astarge e caroskere slugjen, marge len hem mudarge len.<verse eid="MAT 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />A o caro holangja, i bičhalgja pe vojska hem mudargja adalen so mudarge leskere slugjen hem thargja lengoro gradi.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Togaš phengja pe slugjenge: ‘O bijav i spremimo, ama okolen so pokaningjum na zaslužinge te aven. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Adaleske, džan avrik taro gradi hem vikinen kas ka arakhen ko bijav.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Agjar o sluge iklile ko drumija hem khedinge sa e manušen so šaj sine te arakhen hem lošna hem šukar. A i sala e bijaveskiri pherdili gostencar.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Koga o caro khugja te dikhel e gosten, dikhla jekhe manuše so na sine uravdo bijaveskere šeja, <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />i pučlja le: ‘Amala, sar khugjan tu akate, a na sijan uravdo bijaveskere šeja?’ A ov kjutinela sine.<verse eid="MAT 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Togaš o caro phengja pe slugjenge: ‘Phanden leskere vasta hem leskere pre hem frden le avrijal ko najtemno than, kote so ka ovel rojba hem krckjiba dandencar.’<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Adaleske but tane vikime, ama hari tane birime.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O platibe danok e Cezareske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Togaš o fariseja iklile hem dogovoringe pe sar te astaren e Isuse ko lafi. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ola bičhalge ko Isus pumare učenikon zaedno e Irodeskere manušencar te pučen le: “Učitele, džanaja deka vakereja o čačipe hem na ikereja nikaskiri strana, soske na dikheja koj tano koj, nego čače sikaveja o drumo e Devleskoro. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Vaker amenge so mislineja? Trebela li te da e Cezareske o danok ili na?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ama o Isus džangja lengere lošna misle hem phengja lenge: “Dujemujengere! Soske mangena te mestinen man? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Sikav mange o dinari soleja platinena o danok.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Ola ange leske o dinari, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />hem ov pučlja len: “Kaskiri slika hem kaskoro anav tano ko dinari?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Ola phenge: “E Cezareskoro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Togaš o Isus vakergja lenge: “Hem agjar, adava soj e Cezareskoro den le e Cezareske, a adava soj e Devleskoro, den le e Devleske.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Koga ola šunge adava iznenadisalile, mukhle le hem gele.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela bašo uštibe taro mule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Ko adava dive nesave sadukeja so vakerena sine deka nane uštibe taro mule ale ko Isus hem pučle le: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Učitele, o Mojsej phengja: ‘Ako nesavo ženimo manuš mulo, a na mukhla čhave pala peste, leskoro phral trebela te lel leskere romna te šaj oj te bijanel čhave so ka ovel nasledniko e muleskoro.’<verse eid="MAT 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Agjar sine efta phrajla maškar amende. O prvo lela romni hem mulo, ama adaleske so na mukhla čhave pala peste, pe romna mukhla la pe dujtone phraleske. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Agjar mulo o dujto hem o trito phral, hem agjar sa dži ko eftato phral. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ki krajka muli hem i romni. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Togaš kaskiri romni ka ovel oj, koga ka uštel pe taro mule, a sa o phrajla ikerge la?”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Hovavge tumen, soske na džanena o Sveto Lil hem i sila e Devleskiri. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Koga ka ušten taro mule, o manuša nane te len pe, nego ka oven sar angejla ko nebo. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ama bašo uštiba taro mule, na čitingjen li ko Sveto Lil so o Devel phengja tumenge: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Me sijum o Devel e Avraameskoro, e Isakoskoro hem e Jakoveskoro’ so mule angleder? Adaleske ov nane Devel e mulengoro, nego e dživdengoro.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Koga o manuša šunge adava, but čudisalile taro leskoro učibe.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I najbari zapoved</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Koga šunge o fariseja deka o Isus phandla o muj e sadukejengoro khedinge pe, <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />i jekh lendar so sine učiteli e Zakoneskoro, mangla te astarel e Isuse jekhe pučibaja: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Učitele, koja tani i najbari zapoved ko Zakoni e Mojseskoro?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />O Isus odgovoringja leske: “ ‘Mang te Gospodare te Devle sa te srceja, sa te dušaja hem sa te gogjaja.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Akaja tani i prvo hem najbari zapoved. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />A i dujto tani slično sar akaja: ‘Mang te pašutne sar tut so mangeja.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Sa o zapovedija taro Zakoni hem o lila e prorokongere tane ko akala duj zapovedija.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Hristos tano pobaro taro car David</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Dži kote o fariseja sine khedime, o Isus pučlja len: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“So mislinena bašo Hristos? Kaskoro čhavo tano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Ola odgovoringe leske: “E Davideskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />A ov pučlja len: “Sar togaš o David, kerindor lafi preku o Duho vikinela le ‘Gospode?’ Soske ov phengja:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘O Gospodari phengja me Gospodareske:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Beš tari mi desno strana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">sa dži kote na čhivava te dušmanen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">telo te pre.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Ps 110:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Ako o David vikingja le ‘Gospode’, sar šaj o Hristos te ovel leskoro čhavo?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Nikoj na džangja so te phenel leske ko adala lafija. I taro adava dive nikoj više na alo te pučel le.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">O dujmujalipe e vodačengoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Togaš o Isus phengja e narodoske hem pe učenikonge: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“O učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o fariseja bešena sine ko than e Mojsijaskoro te sikaven o Zakoni. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Adaleske mora te pazinen hem te keren sa so ka vakeren tumenge, ama ma keren adava so ola kerena. Soske ola na kerena adava so vakerena. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Ola phandena o pharipe soj pharo hem čhivena le javerenge ko pike, ama ola ni najeja na mangena te mrdinen te pomožinen.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Sa so kerena, kerena le bašo manuša te dikhen len. Buvlarena pumare kutije lafencar taro Sveto Lil hem phiravena len ko čekat ili ko vasta, hem kerena pumare resija<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">resija </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akava značinela čipke ili thava so visinena ko fustani ili ko šeja.</char></note> taro šeja po dugačka. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Mangena te bešen ko najšukar thana ko hajbe pijbe hem ko prvo thana ko sinagoge. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Ola mangena javera te poštojnen len ko pazajra hem te vikinen len ‘Učitele.’<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ama, tumen na trebela te vikinen tumen ‘Učitele’, adaleske so isi tumen samo jekh Učiteli, a tumen sarinen sijen phrajla. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Hem ma vikinen nikas ki phuv ‘dade’, soske isi tumen samo jekh Dad – a ov tano ko nebo. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Ma te vikinen tumen vodačija, soske isi samo jekh Vodači – o Hristos. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />O najbaro maškar tumende neka ovel sluga tumaro. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Soske okola so vazdena pes ka oven ponižime, a okola soj ponižime ka oven vazdime.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O sudo bašo dujmujale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Pharo tumenge, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere hem e farisejenge, dujemujengere! Adaleske so e manušenge phandena o udar taro carstvo nebesno. Tumen korkori na khuvena ki leste, ni tu mukhena okolen so mangena te khuven.<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />[Pharo tumenge, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere hem e farisejenge, dujemujengere! So hana o barvalipe e udovicengoro hem kerena tumen devleskere adaleja so molinena tumen bare molitve. Adaleske ka oven but silno kaznime.]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Pharo tumenge, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere hem e farisejenge, dujemujengere! Adaleske so džana e moreja hem e phuvjaja te šaj te dobinen jekhe manušeskiri vera, a koga dobinena le, kerena le čhavo e pekoleskoro, duj puti pološno tumendar.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Pharo tumenge, so sijen korole vodačija so vakerena: ‘Ako nekoj hala sovli ko Hrami, adava nane ništo. Ama te hala sovli e Hrameskere zlatoja, adale sovlaja phandlo tano.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Glupavonalen, koroljalen! Soj pobaro: o zlato, ili o Hrami so kerela o zlato te ovel sveto? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Hem vakerena: ‘Ako nekoj hala sovli ko oltari, adava nane ništo. Ama te hala sovli ko poklon e oltareskoro, adale sovlaja phandlo tano.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Koroljalen! Soj pobaro: o poklon, ili o oltari so kerela o poklon te ovel sveto? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Adaleske, koj hala sovli ko oltari, hala sovli upro leste hem upro sa so isi ki leste. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Hem sekoj so hala sovli ko Hrami, hala sovli upro leste hem ko okova so bešela ki leste. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Hem koj hala sovli ko nebo, hala sovli e Devleske ko troni hem e Devleste so bešela ki leste.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Pharo tumenge, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere hem e farisejenge, dujemujengere! Adaleske so dena desetok taro tumare žačinja – nane, kopar hem kim, a mukhena o najvažna bukja taro Zakoni – pravda, milost hem vernost. Trebela te den o desetok, ama na trebela te bistren te keren adava soj najvažno. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Korole vodačija! Cedinena o pani taro komarco, ama e kamila gltinena.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Pharo tumenge, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere hem e farisejenge, dujemujengere! Kosena i čaša hem o čaro avrijaldan, a andral sijen pherde so alčnost hem mangena te keren šukar samo tumenge. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Korole fariseja! Prvo kos andraldan i čaša, a poslem avrijaldan da ka ovel čisto.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Pharo tumenge, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere hem e farisejenge, dujemujengere! Tumen sijen sar makhle grobija, so dikhona šuže avrijaldan, ama andraldan tane pherde mulengere kokala hem pherdo melalipe. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Agjar tumen avrijaldan dikhona sar pravednikija, ama andral sijen pherde dujmujalipe hem tumen phagena o Zakoni.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Pharo tumenge, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere hem e farisejenge, dujemujengere! So kerena grobija e prorokonge hem so ukrasinena o spomenikija e pravednikongere, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />a tumen vakeren: ‘Te živina sine ko vreme amare parapaponge, nane sine te ova lencar ko čhoriba o rat e prorokongoro.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Agjar, tumen korkori dokažinena deka sijen o čhave okolengere so mudarge e prorokon. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Keren, dži ko krajo, adava so počminge le tumare parapapija!<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Sapalen! Tumen e sapengere čhave! Sar ka našen adalestar, a te na oven osudime ko pekol? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Adaleske bičhavava prorokija, mudrecija hem učitejla. Nesave lendar ka mudaren hem ka čhiven len ko krsto, a javeren ka kamšikujnen ko sinagoge hem ka brkinen len taro gradi ko gradi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Agjar upra tumende te šaj te perel sa o pravedno rat so thavdingja ki phuv, o rat e Aveleskoro so sine pravedno dži ko rat e Zaharijaskoro, o čhavo e Varahijaeskoro, kas so mudargjen maškar o Sveto Than e Hrameskoro hem o oltari. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Čače vakerava tumenge, sa akava rat ka perel sar kazna upri akaja generacija.”<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus rovela bašo Erusalim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Erusalime, Erusalime, tu so mudareja e prorokon hem frdeja bara upro okola soj tuke bičhavde! But puti manglum te khedav te čhaven, sar so i khani khedela pe piličken telo pe paka, ama tumen na manglen! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Akje, to kher tano napuštimo. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Soske vakerava tumenge nane poviše te dikhen man dži kote na phenena: ‘Blagoslovimo tano okova sa avela ko anav e Gospodareskoro!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">O Hrami so ka ovel rušimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Koga o Isus iklilo taro Hrami te džal peske, leskere učenikija ale uza leste te sikaven leske kozom i šukar kerdo o Hrami.<verse eid="MAT 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />A ov phengja lenge: “Dikhena li sa akava? Čače phenava tumenge, nijekh bar upro bar nane te ačhol akate. Sa ka ovel rušimo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O znakija taro bare nevojle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Dži kote bešela sine o Isus ki Maslinovo gora, o učenikija ale korkori uza leste hem pučle le: “Vaker amenge, koga ka ovel sa akava? Hem savo ka ovel o znako bašo to ajbe hem bašo krajo e svetoskoro?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />O Isus odgovoringja: “Pazinen, ma te hovavel tumen nekoj. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Soske but džene ka aven ko mo anav, hem ka vakeren: ‘Me sijum o Hristos’, hem ka hovaven buten. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Ka šunen deka isi vojne hem deka kerela pe lafi bašo maribe, ama ma daran. Soske sa adava mora te ovel, ama panda nane o krajo. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Ka ušten nacija protiv nacija, hem carstvo protiv carstvo. Ka oven zemijotresija ko razna thana, hem bokhalipe. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Sa akava tano samo o početok taro bijanibaskere dukha.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Togaš ka oven predajme, te oven mučime hem ka mudaren tumen. Hem sa o nacije ka mrzinen tumen baši mange. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ko adava vreme, but džene ka peren tari vera, jekh jekhe ka predajnen hem ka mrzinen. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Ka pojavinen pe but hovavne prorokija hem buten ka hovaven. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Adaleske so ka ovel baro lošnipa hem butengoro mangipe ka šudrol. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ama adava so ka ačhol verno dži ko krajo ka ovel spasimo. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />I akava evangelije bašo carstvo nebesno ka ovel propovedimo ko celo sveto sar svedoštvo sa e narodonge, i togaš ka avel o krajo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I bari bejla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Agjar koga ka dikhen ‘o gadno so uništinela sa’ sar tergjola ko Sveto Than e Hrameskoro, sar so phengja o prorok Daniel – koj čitinela neka svatinel – <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />togaš okola, soj tane ki Judeja, neka našen ko planine. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Koj tano ko krovi, ma te hulel tele hem te khuvel ko kher te lel nešto andral. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />A koj tano ki niva ma te iranel pe khere te le pe šeja. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Hem but pharo ka ovel ko adala dive e khamne romnenge hem adalenge so dena thud! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Molinen tumaro našiba te na ovel ko jeven ili ki sabota. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Soske, togaš ka ovel but pharipe sar dži akana so na sine taro početok e svetoskoro hem nikat poviše nane te ovel isto.<verse eid="MAT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ako o Gospodari na čhinagja adala dive, nikoj našti sine te ovel spasimo. Ama, bašo okola soj birime, ka čhinavel adala dive.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Togaš te phengja tumenge nekoj: ‘Akje o Hristos akate tano!’ ili, ‘Akje okote tano!’, ma verujnen. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Soske ka pojavinen pe hovavne hristosija hem hovavne prorokija, so ka keren bare znakija hem čudija te šaj te probinen te hovaven adalen da soj birime. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Akje, vakergjum tumenge sa angleder.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Adaleske, te vakerge tumenge: ‘Akje tano ki pustina,’ ma džan; ili ‘Akje tano ko garavde thana’, ma verujnen. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Soske sar so o gromi so avela taro istok dikhola pe dži ko zapad, agjar ka ovel o ajbe taro o Čhavo Manušeskoro. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Adava ka ovel jasno agjar sar koga o orlija khedena pe te han adathe kote so isi mulo telo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">O ajbe e Isuseskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“A odma palo problemija ko adala dive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">‘O kham ka temningjovel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">hem i mesečina nane te del pi svetlina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">o čerenja ka peren taro nebo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">hem o nebesna sile ka oven potresime.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Togaš ka pojavinel pe o znako ko nebo taro o Čhavo Manušeskoro. I ko adava vreme sa o plemija ki phuv, ka roven hem ka dikhen o Čhavo Manušeskoro, sar avela upro oblakija bare silaja hem slavaja. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Hem ka bičhavel pe angelen pe silno trubaja hem ola ka kheden leskere birimen taro štar strane e svetoskere, taro jekh krajo dži ko javer krajo e neboskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I sporedba e smokvaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“A tari smokva sikloven akava: Koga lakere granke ka oven kovle hem ka iklon listija, džanen o nilaj tano paše. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Hem agjar tumen, koga ka dikhen sa akala bukja, džanen o vreme i paše, anglo udar. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Čače vakerava tumenge: akaja generacija nane te nakhel dži kote sa akava na ovela. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />O nebo hem i phuv ka nakhen, ama me lafija nikat nane te nakhen.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O dive hem o sati nikoj na džanela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Ama bašo adava dive hem sati nikoj na džanela, ni o angejla taro nebo, ni o Čhavo, samo o Dad. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Sar so sine ko vreme e Noeskoro, agjar ka ovel hem koga o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka avel. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Soske ko adala dive angleder te avel i poplava, o manuša hana sine hem pijena, lena pe sine maškar peste, sa dži ko adava dive koga o Noe khugja ko brodi; <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />a ola ništo na džange so ka ovel sa dži kote na ali i poplava hem legargja sarinen. Agjar ka ovel hem koga o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka avel. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Togaš duj manuša ka oven ki niva. Jekh ka ovel lelo, a o dujto ka ovel mukhlo. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Ako duj džuvla melinena giv, jekh ka ovel leli, a i dujto ka ovel mukhli.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Adaleske oven džangavde, soske na džanena ko kova dive ka avel tumaro Gospodari. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Ama džanen akava: te džanel sine o domakini e khereskoro ko kova sati tari rat ka avel o čor, ka ovel sine džangavdo hem nane sine te mukhel le te khuvel ko kher. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Agjar tumen da trebela te oven spremna, soske o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka avel togaš koga nane te adžikeren le.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O verno hem o neverno sluga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“O verno hem o mudro sluga tano okova kas o gospodari čhiga le upreder e slugenge te šaj te del len hajbe ko vreme. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Blago adale slugaske, koga leskoro gospodari ka avel hem ka arakhel le sar kerela buti agjar. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Čače vakerava tumenge, ov ka čhivel le sar upravniko upro sa leskoro barvalipe. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ama te adava sluga lošno hem phenela ki peste: ‘Nane te avel panda mo gospodari’, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />i počminela te marel javeren slugjen hem te hal hem te pijel e pijanicencar, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />o gospodari adale slugaskoro ka avel ko adava dive koga nane te adžikerel le hem ko adava sati savo ov nane te džanel. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Ka čhinel le ko kotora hem ka čhivel le maškar o dujmujale, kote so ka ovel rojba hem krckjiba dandencar.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo deš čhaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />O Isus phengja: “Togaš o carstvo nebesno ka ovel sar deš čhaja so lele pumare lampe hem iklile te udžaren e džamutre. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Pandž lendar sine glupava, a pandž pametna. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />O glupava lele peja pumare lampe, ama na lele peja ujle bašo pumare lampe, <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />a o pametna lele pumare lampe peja hem ujle da ki tegla. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Adaleske so o džamutro alo pokasno, ola sarine pašlile hem zasuke.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />I ki ekvaš i rat šundilo vikiba: ‘Akje o džamutro! Ikloven te udžaren le!’<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Togaš o deš čhaja uštile hem spreminge pumare lampe.<verse eid="MAT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />O glupava vakerge e pametnonge: ‘Den amen hari taro tumaro ujle, soske amare lampe ačhona.’<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />A o pametna odgovoringe lenge: ‘Našti! Soske nane te resel ni tumenge ni amenge. Ama pošukar te džan hem te kinen tumenge ujle okote kaj so bikinena.’<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ama dži kote džana sine te kinen, alo o džamutro, i okola čhaja so sine spremna khuge leja ko bijav, hem o udar phandlilo.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Palo adava ale okola čhaja hem vikinge: ‘Gospodare! Gospodare, phrav amenge o udar!’<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Ov odgovoringja lenge: ‘Čače vakerava tumenge: Na pendžarava tumen.’<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Adaleske, oven džangavde, soske na džanena ni o dive ni o sati koga ka avel o Čhavo Manušeskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo o vreke e zlatoja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Adaleske o carstvo nebesno ka ovel sar jekh manuš, so angleder te džal ko drumo, vikingja sa pe slugjen hem mukhla lenge po barvalipe. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Jekheske dengja pandž vreke zlato, e dujtoneske dengja duj, a e tritoske jekh – sekaske dengja spored leskiri sposobnost hem palo adava gelo ko drumo.<verse eid="MAT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Okova so dobingja pandž vreke zlato, gelo odma te kerel lencar buti hem zarabotingja panda pandž vreke zlato. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Agjar kergja okova da e duje vrekencar hem zarabotingja panda duj vreke zlato. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ama okova so dobingja jekh vreka gelo, randla dupka ki phuv hem garagja o zlato pe gospodareskere.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Palo but vreme, o gospodari irangja pe hem rodingja e slugendar te phenen leske so kerge adaleja so dengja len. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Okova kaske so dengja pandž vreke zlato, angja okola da pandž vreke hem vakergja: ‘Gospodare, dengjan man pandž vreke zlato, a akje, me zarabotingjum panda pandž.’<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Leskoro gospodari odgovoringja: ‘But šukar! Tu sijan šukar hem verno sluga. Tu sijan verno ko hari, a me ka čhivav tut te vodine but bukja. Ava hem radujn tut te gospodareja.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />I alo okova da e duje vrekencar hem vakergja: ‘Gospodare, dengjan man duj vreke zlato, a akje, me zarabotingjum panda duj.’<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Leskoro gospodari odgovoringja: ‘But šukar! Tu sijan šukar hem verno sluga. Tu sijan verno ko hari, a me ka čhivav tut te vodine but bukja. Ava hem radujn tut te gospodareja.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Togaš alo okova da so dobingja jekh vreka zlato hem vakergja: ‘Gospodare, džanava deka sijan pharo manuš. Khedeja kote so na sejneja hem khedeja kote so na frdingja seme. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Adaleske darandilum hem gelum te garavav to zlato ki phuv. Akje, to zlato, le le.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Leskoro gospodari odgovoringja: ‘Lošno hem mrzalo sluga! Tu džaneja deka me khedava kote so na sejngjum hem khedava kote so na frdingjum seme? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Adaleske trebela sine te de me pare ki banka hem koga ka iranav man, ka ovel man sine zarabotka.<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Adaleske len lestar i vreka e zlatoja hem den la okoleske kas so isi deš vreke. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Soske, kas isi ka del pe leske poviše hem ka ovel le panda poviše taro adava, a kas nane, ka lel pe lestar adava da so isi le. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Hem frden akale nesposobno sluga avrijal ko najtemno than, kote so ka ovel rojba hem krckjiba dandencar.’”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O sudno dive</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Koga o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka avel ki pi slava hem sa o angejla leja, ka bešel ko po slavno troni. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Togaš sa o narodija ka kheden pe angli leste, a ov ka delinel e manušen jekh javerendar sar o pastiri so delinela e bakhren taro buzna. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />E bakhren ka čhivel len tari desno strana, a e buznen tari levo.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Togaš o Caro ka vakerel okolenge tari pi desno strana: ‘Aven, tumen so sijen blagoslovime taro mo Dad hem nasledinen o carstvo, soj spremno baši tumenge panda taro keriba e svetoskoro. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Soske sijum sine bokhalo hem dengjen man te hav, sijum sine žedno hem dengjen man te pijav, sijum sine jabandžija hem primingjen man tumende. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Koga trebingja mange šeja, uragjen man, sijum sine nasvalo hem arakhlen man, sijum sine ko zatvor hem alen te dikhen man.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Togaš o pravednikija ka pučen le: ‘Gospode, koga dikhlem tut bokhalo hem dengjem tut te ha, ili žedno hem dengjem tu te pije? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Koga dikhlem tut sar jabandžija hem primingjem tut amende, ili koga trebela tut sine šeja uravgjem tut? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Koga dikhlem tut nasvalo ili ko zatvor, alem te dikha tut?’<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />A o Caro ka odgovorinel: ‘Čače vakerava tumenge, ako kergjen adava jekheske taro akala me najtikne phrajla, mange kergjen.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Togaš ka vakerel okolenge tari levo strana: ‘Našen mandar tumen so sijen prokletime ki večno jag soj spremimi bašo Beng hem leskere angejla. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Soske koga sijum sine bokhalo na dengjem man te hav, hem sijum sine žedno na dengjem man te pijav. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Sijum sine jabandžija, a na primingjen man tumende, trebela man sine šeja, a na uragjen man. Sijum sine nasvalo hem ko zatvor hem na alen te dikhen man.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Togaš ola ka odgovorinen leske: ‘Gospode, koga dikhlem tut bokhalo hem žedno ili jabandžija ili nango, nasvalo ili ko zatvor, a na pomožingjem tut?’<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />A ov ka odgovorinel: ‘Čače vakerava tumenge, ako na kergjen adava jekheske taro akala najtikne, na kergjen ni mange.’<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Togaš ola ka džan ki večno kazna, ama o pravednikija ko večno životo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">O Evrejska vodačija dogovorinena pe te mudaren e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Koga o Isus završingja sa adava, vakergja pe učenikonge: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Sar so džanena panda duj dive o prazniko Pasha hem o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel predajmo te čhiven le ko krsto.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Togaš o prvosveštenikija hem o starešine e Evrejengere khedinge pe ko dvoro e bare sveštenikoskoro so vikinela pe Kajafa <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />hem dogovoringe pe sar te astaren e Isuse ko hovajbe te šaj te mudaren le.<verse eid="MAT 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ama phenge: “Na ko akava baro Prazniko, te na buninen pe o narodo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro pomazanie ki Vitanija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Dži kote sine o Isus ki Vitanija, ko kher e Simoneskoro o leprozno, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />sar bešela sine ki sofra, ali jekh romni šišeja soj kerdo taro mermeri, a andre ki leste sine skupo mirizlivo ujle, i oj čhorgja le upro leskoro šero.<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Koga o učenikija dikhle adava, holange hem pučle: “Soske bezveze čhorela pe akava ujle? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Akava mirizlivo ujle šaj sine te bikinel pe bute parenge hem o pare te del pe e čorolenge.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />O Isus džangja so vakerena, i pučlja len: “Soske zakačinena akale romna? Oj kergja mange šukaripe. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />O čorole manuša sekat ka oven uza tumende, ama me nane te ovav sekat tumencar. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Oj čhorindor adava mirizlivo ujle upra mande spremingja mo telo bašo parujbe. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Čače vakerava tumenge kote i te propovedinel pe o evangelije ko celo sveto, ka vakerel pe adava so kergja, te šaj sarine setinena pe ki late.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Juda dogovorinela pe te predajnel e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Togaš jekh taro dešuduj učenikija, so vikinela pe sine Juda Iskariot, gelo ko prvosveštenikija <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />hem pučlja len: “Kozom pare ka den man ako predajngjum tumenge e Isuse?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:15">I ola platinge e Judaske trijanda srebrenikija. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Hem taro adava dive ov rodela sine šuži šanca te predajnel e Isuse.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus bičhavela e učenikon te spreminen i Pasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ko prvo dive taro Prazniko e Beskvasno mareske, o učenikija ale uza ko Isus hem pučle: “Kaj mangeja te dža hem te kera tuke te ha o hajbe baši Pasha?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Džan ko gradi ko adava hem adava manuš hem vakeren leske: ‘O učiteli vakerela: Mo vreme tano paše. Tute ka slavinav i Pasha me učenikoncar.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />I o učenikija kerge sar so phengja lenge o Isus hem adathe spreminge o hajbe e Pashakoro.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus phenela jekh taro dešuduj ka predajnel le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Koga rakjilo, o Isus bešla ki sofra pe dešuduje učenikoncar, <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />i dži kote hana sine o Isus phengja lenge: “Čače vakerava tumenge, jekh tumendar ka predajnel man.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ola but razočarisalile, hem počminge te pučen le jekh po jekh: “Te na sijum me adava, Gospode?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />A ov odgovoringja lenge: “Adava so bolela mancar ki činija, ov ka predajnel man. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Čače o Čhavo Manušeskoro mora te merel sar soj pišimo, ama pharo adale manušeske so ka predajnel le! Pošukar ka ovel sine leske te na bijangjovel.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Togaš o Juda, o predavniko leskoro pučlja le: “Te na sijum me adava, Učitele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Agjar i sar so phengjan.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hala i posledno večera e učenikoncar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Dži kote hana sine, o Isus lela o maro, blagodaringja, phagla le hem dengja pe učenikonge hem phengja: “Len hem han, akavaj mo telo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Togaš lela i čaša, blagodaringja hem dengja la lenge vakerindor: “Pijen latar sarine. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Akavaj mo rat e Zaveteskoro, so čhorgjola bute dženenge bašo oprostiba o grevija. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />I vakerava tumenge: nane te pijav više mol, sa dži ko adava dive koga ka pijav tumencar i nevi mol ko carstvo me Dadeskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Togaš gilage gili hem gele ki Maslinovo gora.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar ka otkažinel pe taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Togaš o Isus phengja lenge: “Akaja rat sarinen ka mukhen man, soske i pišimo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 26:31" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">‘Ka mudarav e pastire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">hem o bakhre ka našen.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zah 13:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Ama palo adava, koga ka uštav taro mule, ka džav angleder tumende ki Galileja.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />A o Petar vakergja leske: “I sarinen te mukhle tut, me nikat nane te mukhav tut!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />O Isus phengja leske: “Čače vakerava tuke, akaja rat, angleder o bašno te gilavel, tu trin puti ka phene deka na pendžareja man.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Ama o Petar vakergja leske: “Ako trebela ka merav tuja, ama nikat nane te kerav adava!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Hem isto agjar vakerge sa o učenikija.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskiri molitva ki Getsimanija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Togaš o Isus gelo pe učenikoncar ko than so vikinela pe Getsimanija, i phengja lenge: “Bešen akate dži kote me džava adathe te molina man.”<verse eid="MAT 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Lela peja e Petare hem Zavedejeskere duje čhaven. Hem počmingja te ovel tažno hem te ovel le pharipe. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Togaš phengja lenge: “Doborom mange pharo so osetinava deka mi duša ka phajrol! Ačhoven akate hem oven džangavde mancar.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />I gelo hari podur, pelo mujeja dži ki phuv hem molingja pe vakerindor: “Mo dad, te šaj, cide mandar akaja čaša e pharipaja, ama neka ovel ti vojla, a na mli.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Togaš irangja pe ko učenikija hem arakhla len sar sovena, hem phengja e Petareske: “Našti li sine jekh sati te oven džangavde mancar? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Oven džangavde hem molinen tumen te na peren ko iskušenie. O duho mangela te kerel adava soj šukar, ama o telo tano slabo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />I gelo dujto puti te molinel pe vakerindor: “Mo dad, ako našti cideja akaja čaša e pharipaja, te na pijav latar, neka ovel ti vojla.”<verse eid="MAT 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Koga irangja pe, palem arakhla len sar sovena, soske phandlona sine lengere jakha. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ov mukhla len hem gelo panda jekh puti, i trito puti molingja pe vakerindor ista lafija.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Togaš irangja pe ko učenikija hem phengja lenge: “Panda li sovena hem odmorinena? Akje alo o sati hem o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel predajmo ko vasta e grešnikonge. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Ušten! Te dža! Akje, paše tano mo predavniko.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro astariba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Dži kote o Isus kerela sine lafi, alo o Juda jekh taro dešuduj učenikija. A leja sine bari gužva, čhurikhencar hem kaštencar, bičhavde taro prvosveštenikija hem taro starešine e Evrejengere.<verse eid="MAT 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />A o Juda, leskoro predavniko, angleder dengja len znako vakerindor: “Kas ka čuminav – ov tano. Le astaren.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />I odma alo uza ko Isus hem phengja: “Zdravo učitele!” Hem čumingja le ki čham.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Amala, ker adava soleske alan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Togaš ale o manuša, astarge e Isuse hem phandle le. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Adaleske, jekh okolendar so sine e Isuseja astargja pi čhurik, ikalgja la hem khugja e bare sveštenikoskere sluga hem čhingja o kan leskoro.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Togaš o Isus phengja leske: “Iran i čhurik ko lakoro than, soske sarinen so ka ikaven čhurik ka meren tari čhurik. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Tu mislineja deka našti te rodav me Dadestar te bičhavel mange odma akana poviše taro dešuduj vojske angejla? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ama te kergjum adava, sar ka phergjol o Sveto Lil so vakerela deka adava mora agjar te ovel?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Togaš phengja e manušenge: “Sar buntovnikoske ko than alen čhurikencar hem kaštencar te astaren man? Sekova dive bešava sine ko Hrami hem sikavava sine e manušen, a tumen na astargjen man. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ama, sa akava ulo te šaj te phergjol adava so vakerge o prorokija.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Togaš sa o učenikija mukhle le hem našle.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus anglo baro sudo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Okola so astarge e Isuse, legarge le ko baro svešteniko o Kajafa, kote so khedinge pe sa o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o starešine. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Ama o Petar duraldan džala sine palo Isus, sa dži ko dvoro e bare sveštenikoskoro, i khugja andre hem bešla e čuvarencar te dikhel so ka ovel.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />A o prvosveštenikija, o starešine hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere, rodena sine nesavo hovavno dokaz te arakhen te šaj te mudaren e Isuse, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />ama našti sine te arakhen, iako ale but hovavne svedokija.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:60">A ko krajo ale duj džene <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />hem phenge: “Akava manuš phengja: ‘Šaj te peravav akava Hrami e Devleskoro hem trine divenge palem te vazdav le.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Togaš uštilo o baro svešteniko hem pučlja e Isuse: “Nane li tut so te phene ko akava so vakerena protiv tute?”<verse eid="MAT 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ama o Isus kjutingja.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:63">I o baro svešteniko phengja leske: “Dava tut sovli upro dživdo Devel, phen amenge tu li sijan o Hristos, o Čhavo e Devleskoro?”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Agjar i sar so phengjan. Ama vakerava tumenge: taro akava dive ka dikhen o Čhavo Manušeskoro sar bešela tari desno strana e Najsilno Devleskiri hem sar avela upro oblakija e neboskere.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Togaš o baro svešteniko pharagja pe šeja hem phengja: “Hulingja upro Devel! So trebela amen više svedokija? Akje, akana šungjen sar hulinela. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />So mislinena?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Ola odgovoringe: “Zaslužinela te merel!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Togaš čhungarge le ko muj hem khuge le boksencar. A javera khuvena le sine šamarkencar, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />vakerindor: “Hristos, prorokujn amenge, koj khugja tut?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar otkažinela pe taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Dži kote o Petar bešela sine ko dvoro, ali ki leste jekh slugjinka hem phengja: “Tu da sijan sine e Isuseja tari Galileja!”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />A o Petar anglo sarinen otkažisalilo vakerindor: “Na džanava bašo so pheneja!”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Togaš iklilo avrik angli porta, i dikhla le jekh javer slugjinka hem phengja e manušenge so sine adathe: “Akava sine e Isuseja taro Nazaret!”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Ama o Petar palem otkažisalilo hem hala sovli: “Na pendžarava adale manuše!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Na nakhla but palo adava, okola so sine adathe gele ko Petar hem phenge leske: “Tu čače sijan jekh lendar, soske to keriba lafi adava sikavela.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Togaš o Petar počmingja te del pe armanja hem te hal sovli: “Na pendžarava adale manuše!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">I odma o bašno gilagja. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Togaš o Petar setingja pe ko lafija e Isuseskere so phengja leske: “Angleder o bašno te gilavel, tu trin puti ka phene deka na pendžareja man.” I iklilo avrik hem silno rungja.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">E Judaskoro meriba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Rano sabajleja, sa o prvosveštenikija hem o starešine e narodoskere dogovoringe pe sar te mudaren e Isuse. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Phandle le, legarge le hem denge le ko Pilat, o upravniko e Rimeskoro.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Koga o Juda so predajngja le, dikhla deka o Isus osudimo ko meriba, pelo pišmani hem irangja o trijanda srebrenikija e prvosveštenikonge hem e starešinenge, <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />vakerindor: “Grešingjum! Predajngjum e manuše so nane krivo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">A ola odgovoringe leske: “Adava na interesinela amen. Adavaj to problemi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Togaš o Juda frdingja o srebrenikija ko Hrami, i gelo hem obesingja pe.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />O prvosveštenikija khedinge o srebrenikija hem phenge: “Nane dozvolimo akala te čhiva len ki kasa e Hrameskiri, adaleske so lencar sine platimo bašo rat.”<verse eid="MAT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Adaleske ola dogovoringe pe maškar peste adalencar te kinen i niva e glinadžijaskiri, hem te ovel grobija kote so ka parunen e jabandžijen. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Adaleske, avdive da adaja niva vikinela pe “Ratvali niva.” <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Agjar pherdilo okova so sine phendo taro prorok Eremija:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 27:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 27:9">“Lele o trijanda srebrenikija,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 27:9">doborom ceninge le o Izraelcija,<verse eid="MAT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />hem kinge i niva e glinadžijaskiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 27:10">sar so o Gospodari zapovedingja mange.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:6-9">Ere 32:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zah 11:12-13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus anglo Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />A o Isus terdilo anglo upravniko e Rimeskoro, kova so pučlja le: “Tu li sijan o caro e Evrejengoro?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Adava tu pheneja.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />O prvosveštenikija hem o starešine kerena sine krivo e Isuse, ama ov ništo na odgovorinela sine.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Togaš o Pilat pučlja le: “Na šuneja li kozom kerena tut krivo?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ama o Isus na odgovoringja ni jekhe lafeske so sine phendo protiv leste, i o Pilat čudinela pe sine.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />A o upravniko o Pilat ki sekoja Pasha sine le adeti te oslobodinel po jekh zatvoreniko, so o narodo ka roden lestar. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Ko adava vreme sine jekh prešundo zatvoreniko so vikinela pe sine Varava.<verse eid="MAT 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Koga o narodo khedisalilo, o Pilat pučlja len: “Kas mangena te oslobodinav tumenge: e Varava ili e Isuse, soj vikimo Hristos?”<verse eid="MAT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Adaleske so ov džanela sine deka ola predajnge e Isuse tari ljubomora.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Dži kote o Pilat bešela sine ki stolica e sudoskiri, leskiri romni bičhalgja te vakeren leske: “Mukh adale manuše so nane krivo, soske avdive but cidingjum baši leske ko suno.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Ama o prvosveštenikija hem o starešine pherge e narodo te roden e Varava, a o Isus te ovel mudardo.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />O upravniko pučlja len: “Kas taro akala duj mangena te oslobodinav tumenge?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Ola odgovoringe: “E Varava!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />A o Pilat pučlja len: “So te kerav e Isuseja soj vikimo Hristos?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Ola sarine odgovoringe: “Čhiv le ko krsto!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />I ov pučlja: “Soske? Savo lošnipe kergja?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Ama ola panda poviše vikinge: “Čhiv le ko krsto!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />O Pilat koga dikhla deka o narodo vazdena bari buna hem deka našti iklola lencar ko krajo, lela pani hem thogja pe vasta anglo narodo, vakerindor: “Me na sijum krivo bašo o rat akale manušeskoro – adavaj tumari buti!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />A sa o narodo odgovoringja: “Leskoro rat neka perel upro amende hem upro amare čhave!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Palo adava o Pilat mukhla lenge e Varava, a e Isuse dengja te kamšikujnen le hem te čhiven le ko krsto.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O vojnikija asana e Isuseske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Togaš o vojnikija legarge e Isuse ki palata e Pilateskiri hem vikinge celo vojska te kheden pe uza leste. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Hulage lestar hem urage le carsko mantili. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />I pletinge kruna taro kare hem čhige la leske ko šero, a ko desno vas denge le carsko kaš. Togaš pele ko kočaka angli leste hem khelge peske leja vakerindor: “Zdravo, Evrejsko care!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />I čhungarena le sine, hem lele lestar o kaš hem khuvena le sine ko šero.<verse eid="MAT 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />A palo adava koga khelge peske leja, ikalge lestar o mantili, hem urage le leskere šeja hem legarge te čhiven le ko krsto.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuse čhivena ko krsto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ko iklojbe, arakhle nesave manuše tari Kirineea, so leskoro anav sine Simon, hem čhige le te phiravel o krsto e Isuseskoro. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Koga resle ko adava than so vikinela pe Golgota – so značinela than e “Čerepeskoro.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Denge le mol te pijel so sine mešimi kjerke žolčkaja, ama koga probingja la, na mangla te pijel.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />I koga čhige le ko krsto, delinge leskere šeja agjar so frdinge ždrepka te dikhen koj so ka lel. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />I bešle adathe hem arakhena le sine.<verse eid="MAT 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Upreder o šero leskoro čhige pišimo natpis baši leskiri krivica:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MAT 27:37">“AKAVAJ O ISUS, O CARO E EVREJENGORO.”<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />A leja čhige ko krsto duje buntovnikon, jekh tari desno strana, hem jekh tari levo strana.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />A okola so nakhena sine, iranindor po šero uvredžinena le sine, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />vakerindor: “Tu so peraveja o Hrami hem vazdeja le trine divenge, spasin tut! Huli tele taro krsto, ako sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Isto agjar asana sine o prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o starešine vakerindor: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Javeren spasingja, a korkori pes našti te spasinel! Ov tano o caro e Izraeleskoro! Neka hulel akana taro krsto, i ka verujna ki leste. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Ov nadinela pe ko Devel! Neka spasinel le o Devel akana, ako čače mangela le. Soske vakerela sine: ‘Me sijum o Čhavo e Devleskoro.’”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Agjar uvredžinena le sine okola da so sine leja ko krsto.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro meriba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />A ko dešuduj o sati, temnisalilo ki celo phuv hem agjar sine trin satija. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Koga sine trin o sati paloručko, o Isus vikingja sa pe glasoja: <char style="it">“Eli, Eli, lema sabahtani?” </char> (so značinela “Mo Devel, mo Devel, soske mukhlan man?”)<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Koga šunge adava nesave so tergjovena sine, vakerge: “Vikinela e Ilija.”<verse eid="MAT 27:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Odma nekoj lendar prastandilo, hem topingja o sungjeri ko šut hem čhiga le ko kaš hem dengja e Isuse te pijel.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />A javera vakerge: “Adžikeren te dikha dali o Ilija ka avel te spasinel le.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />A o Isus palem vikingja sa pe glasoja, hem mukhla pi duša.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ko adava momenti, i zavesa taro Hrami pharavdili ko ekvaš upral dži tele. I phuv silno tresisalili hem o karpe pharile. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />O grobija phravdile hem uštile taro mule but manuša so sine sveta. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Palo e Isuseskoro uštiba taro mule ola iklile taro grobija hem gele ko sveto gradi Erusalim hem sikavge pe bute manušenge.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Koga o Rimsko kapetani hem okola da so arakhena sine e Isuse dikhle o zemjotres hem sa so ulo, but darandile hem phenge: “Čače, akava sine o Čhavo e Devleskoro!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />A adathe sine but džuvla so dikhena le sine duraldan. Ola panda tari Galileja džana sine palo Isus hem pomožinena le sine. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Maškar lende sine i Marija tari Magdala, hem Marija i daj e Jakoveskiri hem e Josifeskiri, hem i daj e Zavedejeskere čhavengiri.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro parujba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Dži kote rakjola sine, alo jekh barvalo manuš tari Arimateja, so vikinela pe Josif, koj korkori ov sine učeniko e Isuseskoro.<verse eid="MAT 27:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Ov gelo ko Pilat hem rodingja o telo e Isuseskoro. I o Pilat naredingja te den le o telo e Isuseskoro. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />O Josif lela o telo, pakjargja le ko nevo laneno čaršafi, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />hem čhigja le ko po nevo grobo, so sine kerdi dupka ki karpa. Hem guringja baro bar ko udar taro grobo, i gelo peske. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />A i Marija tari Magdala hem okoja Marija bešle adathe karši o grobo.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O čuvajra ko grobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Tajsutno dive, ki sabota, o prvosveštenikija hem o fariseja gele ko Pilat <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />hem phenge leske: “Gospodare, setingjem amen ko okova o hovavno, dži kote sine dživdo phengja: ‘Palo trin dive ka uštav taro mule.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Adaleske, naredin o grobo te arakhen le trin dive, te na aven leskere učenikija hem te čoren o telo, i te phenen e narodoske: ‘Uštilo taro mule.’ I akava hovajbe ka ovel pološno taro prvo puti.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />O Pilat odgovoringja lenge: “Isi tumen čuvajra! Džan hem obezbedinen o grobo sar so džanena!”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />I gele hem obezbedinge o grobo agjar so čhige pečati ko bar hem čhige čuvajra.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro uštiba taro mule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Pali sabota, rano sabajle ko prvo dive taro kurko, i Marija tari Magdala hem okoja Marija gele te dikhen o grobo.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Taro jekh puti sine baro zemjotres, adaleske so o angeli e Gospodareskoro hulingja taro nebo, alo ko grobo, cidingja o bar hem bešla upro leste. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Leskoro izgled sine sar o gromi hem leskere šeja sine parne sar o iv. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />O čuvajra doborom darandile so počminge te tresinen hem ule sar mule.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />A o angeli phengja e romnenge: “Ma daran! Džanava deka rodena e Isuse so mulo ko krsto. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Ov nane akate; uštilo taro mule, sar so phengja tumenge. Aven hem dikhen o than kaj so pašlilo. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />I džan sigate hem vakerena leskere učenikonge: ‘Uštilo taro mule hem džala angleder tumendar ki Galileja. Adathe ka dikhen le.’ Akje vakergjum tumenge.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />I ola sigate gele peske daraja taro grobo hem so bari radost prastandile te vakeren leskere učenikonge.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Taro jekh puti resla len o Isus hem phengja lenge: “Zdravo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 28:9">A ola ale uza leste, astarge leskere pre hem pokloninge pe leske.<verse eid="MAT 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Togaš o Isus phengja lenge: “Ma daran. Džan hem vakeren me phralenge te džan ki Galileja. Adathe ka dikhen man.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O sveštenikija dena pare e čuvaren te hovaven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Dži kote o romnja sine ko drumo, nesave taro čuvajra khuge ko gradi hem vakerge e prvosveštenikonge sa so ulo. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Ola khedinge pe e starešinencar hem dogovoringe pe te den but pare e vojnikonge.<verse eid="MAT 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />I phenge lenge: “Vakeren: ‘Leskere učenikija ale rakjate hem čorge leskoro telo dži kote amen sovaja sine.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />A te šungja bašo akava o Pilat, amen ka kera leja lafi hem ka sredina te na ovel tumen problemija.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />O vojnikija lele o pare hem kerge sar so sine lenge phendo. Hem akaja prikazna vakerela pe maškar o Evreja sa dži avdive.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus bičhavela e apostolen te vakeren o evangelije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Togaš o dešujekh učenikija gele ki Galileja, ki planina kaj so phengja lenge o Isus. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />I koga dikhle le, pele ko kočaka anglo leste. Ama nesave lendar sumninge pe.<verse eid="MAT 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Togaš o Isus alo uza lende hem phengja lenge: “Dendi mange celo vlast ko nebo hem ki phuv. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Adaleske džan hem keren e manušen taro sa o nacije te oven me učenikija hem krstinen len ko anav e Dadeske, e Čhaveske hem e Sveti Duhoske <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />hem sikaven len te ikeren sa so zapovedingjum tumenge. Akje, me sijum tumencar ko sa o dive, dži ko krajo e svetoskoro.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>